Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.00,0:05:26.80,Title,,0,0,0,,《海底总动员》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.56,0:00:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哇 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wow. - Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.79,0:00:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哇 - 嗯哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wow. - Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.93,0:01:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哇 - 是的, 莫林\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wow. - Yes, Marlin.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.10,0:01:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到了 这真是太美了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I see it. It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.24,0:01:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,记得么, 卡萝, 当你说你想看到这个海洋的景色的时候…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Coral, when you said you wanted an ocean view...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.80,0:01:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,没想到我们会搬到海边来住 想过吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}you didn't think you'd get the whole ocean, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.01,0:01:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,喔, 耶 这里可是鱼的自由天地啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. A fish can breathe out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.85,0:01:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你说你老公我, 说话算不算数啊?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did your man deliver, or did he deliver?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.82,0:01:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 算数, 行了吧 - 我可是费了不少波折的啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My man delivered. - And it wasn't so easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.15,0:01:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,因为有许多其他的小丑鱼也觊觎这块地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because a lot of other clownfish had their eyes on this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.49,0:01:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你最好相信这点-他们谁不想住这啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better believe they did... every single one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.96,0:01:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 你做得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm-hmm. You did good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.03,0:01:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,还有邻居们是在是太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the neighborhood is awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.67,0:01:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,那么, 你喜欢这里, 是不是?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you do like it, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.37,0:01:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,是的, 是的 我喜欢, 我喜欢 我真的很喜欢这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. I do, I do. I really do like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.88,0:01:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,但是, 莫林, 我知道住在这里会很惬意…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Marlin, I know that the drop off is desirable...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.85,0:01:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,伴随着大学校和这美妙的风景…\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the great schools and the amazing view...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.15,0:01:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我们真的需要这么大的地方吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}but do we really need so much space?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.92,0:01:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我们真的需要这么大的地方吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}But do we really need so much space?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.25,0:01:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,卡萝, 亲爱的, 我们在说我们的孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coral, honey, these are our kids we're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.09,0:01:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,他们应该得到最好的东西 看, 看, 看\N{\fnArial\fs30}They deserve the best. Look, look, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.29,0:02:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,他们醒来, 把他们小小的脑袋从这里探出来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll wake up, poke their little heads out...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.56,0:02:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,然后他们看到了一只鲸鱼! 就在他们卧房的窗户外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they see a whale! Right by their bedroom window.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.43,0:02:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,然后他们看到了一只鲸鱼! 就在他们卧房的窗户外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they see a whale! Right by their bedroom window.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.66,0:02:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,嘘 你会吵醒孩子们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh. You'll wake the kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.00,0:02:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,喔, 好的, 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.54,0:02:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,噢, 看 他们还在梦乡中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, look. They're dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.34,0:02:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还要给他们起名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}We still have to name them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.54,0:02:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在想给所有这些孩子起名字?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to name all of them right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.34,0:02:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧, 我们把这一半叫做小莫林…\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we'll name this half Marlin Junior...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.65,0:02:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这一半叫做小卡萝\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this half Coral Junior.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.82,0:02:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好了, 我们就这么决定了 - 我喜欢尼莫这个名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}- OK, we're done. - I like Nemo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.42,0:02:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,尼莫 我们只能选其中的一个叫尼莫…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nemo. We'll name one Nemo...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.22,0:02:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我愿意把其他的都叫做小莫林\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'd like most of them to be Marlin Junior.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.82,0:02:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,只要一想, 用不了几天…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just think, in a couple of days...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.23,0:02:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们就要当爸爸妈妈了 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- we're going to be parents. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.76,0:02:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,他们要是不喜欢我怎么办?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if they don't like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.43,0:02:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 莫林 - 不, 是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Marlin. - No, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.00,0:02:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这里有400多个蛋 按机率来算总会有一个会喜欢你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's over 400 eggs. Odds are, one will like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.14,0:02:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.34,0:02:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你还记得我们是怎么认识的吗? - 我不想记起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You remember how we met? - I try not to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.01,0:02:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,那好, 我记得 对不起, 小姐…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I remember. "Excuse me, miss...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.51,0:02:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你能帮我看一下我嘴唇上是否有个鱼钩?\N{\fnArial\fs30}"can you check and see if I have a hook in my lip?"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.02,0:03:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你靠近一点呀, 因为它还在晃动着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a little closer because it was wiggling.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.42,0:03:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 走开, 走开! - 我来啦 美人在这呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get away, get away! - Here he is. Cutie's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.42,0:03:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都去哪了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did everybody go?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.30,0:03:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,卡萝, 快回房子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coral, get inside the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.94,0:03:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,不, 卡萝, 别动 孩子们不会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Coral, don't. They'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.37,0:03:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,快进去-你快点, 现在就进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just get inside... You, right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.74,0:03:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,不! 噢!\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.65,0:03:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,喔!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.58,0:03:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,哦! 哦!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh! Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.13,0:03:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,卡萝!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coral!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.90,0:03:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,卡萝?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coral?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.04,0:03:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,卡萝?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coral?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.25,0:04:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,卡萝?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coral?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.95,0:04:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,卡萝?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coral?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.29,0:04:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,卡萝?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coral?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.54,0:04:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,噢!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.72,0:04:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.72,0:04:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,好了, 好了, 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There, there, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.59,0:04:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,没事了 爸爸在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's OK. Daddy's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.32,0:04:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸找到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy's got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.83,0:04:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我保证, 我不会再让你出什么事了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise, I will never let anything happen to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.40,0:04:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,尼莫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nemo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.64,0:05:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,尼莫: 开学啦!\N{\fnArial\fs30}First day of school!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.07,0:05:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,起来, 起来! 开学第一天啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up, wake up! First day of school.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.91,0:05:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想上学-再睡五分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to go to school... five more minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.45,0:05:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不是你, 老爸, 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not you, Dad, me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.75,0:05:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好吧 啊? - 起来, 起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- OK. Huh? - Get up, get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.18,0:05:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,该去上学了, 该去上学了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time for school, time for school.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.92,0:05:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧, 我起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I'm up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.52,0:05:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,哇!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.22,0:05:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 尼莫! - 开学第一天!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nemo! - First day of school!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.99,0:05:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 尼莫, 不要动 - 啊! 啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nemo, don't move. - Unh! Unh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.19,0:05:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你自己出不来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll never get out of there yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.63,0:05:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我来帮你 啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do it. Unh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.83,0:06:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你需要休息一下吗? - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You feel a break? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.83,0:06:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,有时候你会分辨不清, 因为这个地区有急流\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes you can't tell 'cause fluid rushes to the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.60,0:06:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你头晕吗? - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you woozy? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.84,0:06:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我有多少个条纹? - 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How many stripes do I have? - I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.14,0:06:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 回答我的问题 - 三条\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Answer the stripe question. - Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.97,0:06:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,不! 看到了吗? 你肯定有毛病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! See? Something's wrong with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.47,0:06:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我有 一、二、三-我只有这么多么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have one, two, three... That's all I have?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.31,0:06:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事了 你的幸运鳍怎么样了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're OK. How's the lucky fin?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.25,0:06:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 幸运鳍 - 让我们看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lucky. - Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.52,0:06:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你确认你今年想去上学吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure you want to go to school this year?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.05,0:06:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你如果不想去也没有关系 你可以再等个五六年再去\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no problem if you don't. You can wait 5 or 6 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.99,0:06:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,老爸, 该去上学了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Dad, it's time for school.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.89,0:06:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你忘记擦防护油了 - 噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Forgot to brush. - Ohh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.59,0:06:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你想让这个海葵刺疼你吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want this anemone to sting you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.63,0:06:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 快擦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - Brush.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.06,0:06:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好了, 擦完了 - 有一点没擦到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- OK, I'm done. - You missed a spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.77,0:06:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哪? - 那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where? - There.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.07,0:06:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哪? - 那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where? - There.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.77,0:06:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,哈哈! 就是那 还有这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha ha! Right there. And here and here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.51,0:06:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,好了, 我们都很激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we're excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.71,0:06:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好了, 我们都很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we're excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.91,0:06:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,第一天去上学 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first day of school. Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.72,0:06:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要学一些知识\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're ready to learn to get some knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.72,0:06:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,对于海洋我们要记住哪一点?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the one thing we have to remember about the ocean?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.15,0:06:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 它并不安全 - 好孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's not safe. - That's my boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.62,0:07:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,首先, 我们要检查一下是否畅通无阻\N{\fnArial\fs30}First, we check to see that the coast is clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.93,0:07:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我们出去…回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We go out... and back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.36,0:07:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我们出去… 回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then we go out... and back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.70,0:07:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,然后再来一次-出去…再回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then one more time... out and back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.77,0:07:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,有的时候, 甚至你要来回四次...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And sometimes, if you want to do it four times...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.64,0:07:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 老爸… - 好吧, 我们走, 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dad... - All right, come on, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.71,0:07:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,可能我在学校的时候, 我会见到鲨鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe while I'm at school, I'll see a shark.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.84,0:07:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我对这点表示非常的怀疑 - 你曾经见到过鲨鱼吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I highly doubt that. - Have you ever met a shark?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.55,0:07:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,没有, 我也不想见到\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, and I don't plan to.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.25,0:07:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这些海龟有多大了? - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How old are sea turtles? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.48,0:07:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,隔壁的山笛叔叔说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sandy Plankton from next door...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.22,0:07:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他说这些海龟已经活了大约100年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he says that sea turtles live to be about 100 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.12,0:07:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他说这些海龟已经活了大约100年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says that sea turtles live to be about 100 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.59,0:07:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我见到海龟的话, 我会问他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I ever meet a sea turtle, I'll ask him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.89,0:07:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,在我和鲨鱼谈完话以后, 好吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}After I'm done talking to the shark, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.86,0:07:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,哇! 等一下 等红灯亮再过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! Hold on. Wait to cross.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.43,0:07:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,哇! 等一下 等红灯亮再过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! Hold on. Wait to cross.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.50,0:07:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,抓住我的鳍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold my fin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.74,0:07:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,老爸, 你又要像上次在宠物公园一样…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, you're not going to freak out...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.10,0:07:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,大惊小怪吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}like you did at the petting zoo, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.14,0:07:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,看好那只海螺, 他正要向你扑过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}That snaiI was about to charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.94,0:07:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 我在想我们要去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. I wonder where we're supposed to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.41,0:07:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,再见, 妈妈!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye, Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.95,0:07:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,放学后我会去接你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll pick you up after school.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.08,0:07:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,哈哈!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.82,0:08:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,快, 你们这些家伙, 不要! 把它还给我!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, you guys, stop it! Give it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.92,0:08:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,来, 我们去那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, we'll try over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.26,0:08:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起, 这里是见老师的地方吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, is this where we meet his teacher?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.36,0:08:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,喔, 看看是谁从海葵里出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, look who's out of the anemone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.93,0:08:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 你们很惊讶, 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Shocking, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.63,0:08:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我很少出门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Shocking, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.16,0:08:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 玛蒂, 是不是? - 莫林\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Marty, right? - Marlin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.96,0:08:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 鲍勃 - 柯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bob. - Ted.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.17,0:08:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,比尔 嘿, 你是个小丑鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bill. Hey, you're a clownfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.20,0:08:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你很搞笑, 对不对? 给我们讲个笑话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're funny, right? Tell us a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.80,0:08:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 耶 - 耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.14,0:08:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,那个, 事实上, 这通常是个误解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, actually, that's a common misconception.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.07,0:08:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,小丑鱼不会比其他鱼搞笑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clownfish are no funnier than any other fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.64,0:08:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 来吧, 小丑 - 来些有趣的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, clownie. - Do something funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.68,0:08:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧, 我知道一个段子\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I know one joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.18,0:08:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,有一个软体动物, 知道吗? 他向大海走过去...\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a mollusk, see? And he walks up to a sea...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.29,0:08:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,他不是走过去的, 他是游过去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't walk up, he swims up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.39,0:08:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,事实上, 软体动物是不能动窝的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, the mollusk isn't moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.29,0:08:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,他就待在原地, 然后那个海参…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in one place, and then the sea cucumber...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.89,0:08:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,那个, 他们-我弄混了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they... I'm mixed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.39,0:08:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,有一个软体动物, 和一个海参\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a mollusk and a sea cucumber.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.16,0:08:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀, 我说乱了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of them were walking, so forget that l...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.17,0:08:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,软体动物和海参他们都不会走, 我刚才讲得不对...\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of them were walking, so forget that l...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.77,0:08:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,快离开那片院子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheldon! Get out of Mr. Johannsen's yard now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.04,0:08:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哇! - 好吧, 你们这些小家伙!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whoa! - All right, you kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.44,0:08:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,喔, 你们想往哪跑?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh, where'd you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.54,0:08:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,老爸, 我也可以去玩吗? 可以吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, can I go play, too? Can I?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.74,0:09:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你去玩那些海绵垫子我会感觉好一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would feel better if you'd play on the sponge beds.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.32,0:09:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我以前常去\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where I would play.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.92,0:09:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他的鳍是怎么了? - 他看起来很有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's wrong with his fin? - He looks funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.39,0:09:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,喔! 嘿, 我怎么了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow! Hey, what'd I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.79,0:09:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不懂礼貌 这是他第一次来学校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be nice. It's his first time at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.79,0:09:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,他生来就有那个 我们叫它幸运鳍\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was born with it. We call it his lucky fin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.60,0:09:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 老爸… - 看到这个触角了么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dad... - See this tentacle?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.83,0:09:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,事实上这个比我其他的触角短…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's actually shorter than all my other tentacles...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.00,0:09:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你几乎看不出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you can't really tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.17,0:09:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,尤其是我这样摆动的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially when I twirl them like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.64,0:09:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我对海水严重过敏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm H-2-O intolerant.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.74,0:09:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 啊-咻! - 我有过动症\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ah-choo! - I'm obnoxious.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.74,0:09:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 哦 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Oh ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.35,0:09:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 让我们给这些地方起名字, 这些地方, 这些地方 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Let's name the zones, the zones, the zones ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.22,0:09:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 让我们给广阔的海洋起名字 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Let's name the zones of the open sea ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.42,0:09:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,雷老师来了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Ray!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.65,0:09:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 来吧, 尼莫 - 你最好和我待在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, Nemo. - You better stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.59,0:09:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 海洋中层, 半深海, 和深海区域 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Mesopelagic, bathyal, abyssalpelagic ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.49,0:09:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 其它的地方对于你我都太深了所以看不到 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ All the rest are too deep for you and me to see ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.96,0:09:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,哈 我想知道我的学生都哪去了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh. I wonder where my class has gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.33,0:09:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在下面呢!\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're under here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.10,0:09:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,哦, 你们在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, there you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.00,0:09:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,上船了, 探险家们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Climb aboard, explorers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.60,0:10:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 喔, 充满知识的探险 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Oh, knowledge exploring ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.94,0:10:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 喔, 多么的愉快 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Is, oh, so lyrical ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.47,0:10:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 当你考虑你的想法的时候那是以经验为根据的 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ When you think thoughts that are empirical ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.94,0:10:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,老爸, 你可以走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, you can go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.14,0:10:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你好 这是谁? - 我是 尼莫\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello. Who is this? - I'm Nemo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.28,0:10:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,尼莫, 所有新来的探险者必须回答一个科学问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nemo, all new explorers must answer a science question.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.98,0:10:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 你住在一个什么样的房子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- OK. - You live in what kind of home?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.82,0:10:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,在海葵…葵\N{\fnArial\fs30}An anemon-none.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.55,0:10:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,在海…海…葵…葵里\N{\fnArial\fs30}A nemenem-menome.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.59,0:10:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,好了, 好了, 闪了舌头就不好了 欢迎上船, 探险家们\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, don't hurt yourself. Welcome aboard, explorers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.66,0:10:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,就像你知道的那样, 他的鳍很小\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just so you know, he's got a little fin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.63,0:10:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,游泳不方便…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I find if he's having trouble swimming...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.33,0:10:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,游10 到 15 分钟, 我会让他休息一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I let him take a break, 10, 15 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.33,0:10:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,老爸, 你该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, it's time for you to go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.80,0:10:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不要担心 我们会像一个团队一样待在一起的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. We're gonna stay together as a group.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.90,0:10:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,好了, 同学们, 都向前看\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, class, optical orbits up front.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.34,0:10:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,还有要记住, 上课时注意认真听讲 同学之间不准交头接耳\N{\fnArial\fs30}And remember, we keep our supraesophogeal ganglion...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.38,0:10:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我在说你呐, 吉米\N{\fnArial\fs30}to ourselves. That means you, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.84,0:10:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,噢, 伙计!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.94,0:10:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,噢, 伙计!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.85,0:10:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,再见, 尼莫!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye, Nemo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.92,0:10:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,再见, 老爸!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.35,0:10:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,再见, 儿子!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye, son!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.22,0:10:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,注意安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.06,0:10:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,对第一次来说你已经做得很不错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're doing pretty well for a first-timer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.66,0:10:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不能总守着他一辈子, 是不是?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't hold on to them forever, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.03,0:10:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不过他们经过峭壁的时候我总是不太放心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a tough time with my oldest out at the drop off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.30,0:11:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的成长总是要经过-峭壁! ?\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got to grow up... The drop off?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.60,0:11:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他们要去峭壁? 你们是怎么了, 精神不正常吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're going to the drop off? What are you, insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.50,0:11:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我们为什么不现在就把他们来个油炸, 然后切成小块端上去?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't we fry them up now and serve them with chips?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.84,0:11:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿, 玛蒂, 冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Marty, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.14,0:11:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不要让我冷静, 小马哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't tell me to be calm, pony boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.44,0:11:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,小马哥?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pony boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.78,0:11:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,对于一个小丑鱼来说, 他的笑话很冷\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a clownfish, he really isn't that funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.68,0:11:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,可惜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.15,0:11:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 哦 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Oh ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.02,0:11:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 让我们来给生物起名字, 这些生物, 这些生物 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Let's name the species, the species, the species ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.62,0:11:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 让我们来给生活在海里的生物起名字 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Let's name the species that live in the sea ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.95,0:11:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.16,0:11:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 那就是 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ There's ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.99,0:11:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 海绵动物, 腔肠动物, 水螅纲, 钵水母纲 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Porifera, coelenterata, hydrozoa, scyphozoa ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.09,0:11:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 珊瑚虫类, 栉水母类, 苔藓虫门, 三个 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Anthozoa, ctenophora, bryozoas, three ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.19,0:11:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 似腹足纲, 节足动物门, 棘皮类 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Gastropoda, arthropoda, echinoderma ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.90,0:11:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 还有像你还像我的鱼 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ And some fish like you and me ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.23,0:11:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧, 和我一起唱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, sing with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.60,0:11:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 哦 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Oh ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.81,0:11:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,那么这次女孩们来唱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the girls this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.71,0:11:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 哦, 海草真好 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Oh, seaweed is cool ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.71,0:11:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 海草真有趣 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Seaweed is fun ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.01,0:11:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 它自己做吃的 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ It makes its food ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.78,0:11:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,好了, 峭壁到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, the drop off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.85,0:11:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,好了, 孩子们, 自由的去探险吧…\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, kids, feel free to explore...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.16,0:11:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,但是要一起走\N{\fnArial\fs30}but stay close.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.36,0:12:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是蓝藻菌吗! 快过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stromalitic cyanobacteria! Gather.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.89,0:12:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的小细菌也有完整的生态系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}An entire ecosystem contained in one infinitesimal speck.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.66,0:12:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,有许多的蛋白质包含在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are as many protein pairs contained in this...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.36,0:12:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,快, 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.83,0:12:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧, 和我一起唱!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, sing with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.23,0:12:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 有海绵动物, 腔肠动物 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ There's porifera, coelenterata ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.54,0:12:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 水螅纲, 钵水母纲 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Hydrozoa, scyphozoa ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.04,0:12:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 珊瑚虫类, 栉水母类, 苔藓虫门, 三个 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Anthozoa, ctenophora, bryozoas, three ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.61,0:12:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿, 等一下!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys, wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.71,0:12:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.61,0:12:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.39,0:12:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,救了你的命!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saved your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.05,0:12:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,噢, 你们吓死我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, you guys made me ink.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.82,0:12:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.69,0:12:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道那是什么 山蒂叔叔曾经看到过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what that is. Sandy Plankton saw one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.76,0:12:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,他说那个东西叫"屁股"\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said it was called a butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.90,0:12:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哇 - 喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whoa. - Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.37,0:12:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,那可真是一个大屁股\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a pretty big butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.14,0:12:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,噢, 看我的 我要去摸那个大屁股\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, look at me. I'm going to touch the butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.37,0:12:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 啊-咻! 哇! - 哈哈哈!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ah-choo! Whoa! - Ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.88,0:12:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,哦, 耶? 你走近点让我们看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah? Let's see you get closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.71,0:12:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.38,0:13:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,太容易了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beat that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.92,0:13:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,来啊, 尼莫 你能游多远?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Nemo. How far can you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.49,0:13:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我爸爸说那不安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad says it's not safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.99,0:13:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 尼莫! 不! - 爸爸?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nemo! No! - Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.96,0:13:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你要游到海面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were about to swim into open water.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.43,0:13:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,不, 我没有...\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I wasn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.70,0:13:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,多亏我在这里 如果我没出现...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good thing I was here. If I hadn't shown up...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.56,0:13:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他没要过去 - 他太害怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He wasn't going to go. - He was too afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.87,0:13:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不, 我不怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.20,0:13:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这和你们没关系, 孩子们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This does not concern you, kids...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.67,0:13:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你们很幸运我不会告诉你们的家长\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're lucky I don't tell your parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.07,0:13:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道你游泳技术还不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know you can't swim well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.41,0:13:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我游得很好, 老爸, 行吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can swim fine, Dad, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.37,0:13:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不, 那不好 你不应该靠近这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's not OK. You shouldn't be near here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.31,0:13:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,好了, 我是对的 你还是过一两年再上学吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, I was right. You'll start school in a year or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.75,0:13:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不, 老爸! 只是因为你害怕大海...\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Dad! Just because you're scared of the ocean...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.52,0:13:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,已经很清楚了, 你还没有准备好…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clearly, you're not ready...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.98,0:13:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,已经很清楚了, 你还没有准备好…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clearly, you're not ready...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.72,0:13:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,在你没准备好之前你要到这里来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're not coming back untiI you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.92,0:13:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你认为你可以做这些事…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you can do these things...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.22,0:13:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你还做不到, 尼莫!\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you just can't, Nemo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.46,0:13:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我恨你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.26,0:13:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 那是 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ There's ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.93,0:13:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么好看的 到这来 去那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing to see. Gather. Over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.80,0:13:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 我可以帮你吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. Is there anything I can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.10,0:13:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,先生, 我是他们的科学老师 出什么事了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a scientist, sir. Is there any problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.20,0:13:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 我不是故意要打断你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I didn't mean to interrupt things.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.34,0:13:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,他游泳技术还不行, 在没有允许的情况下就到那去\N{\fnArial\fs30}He isn't a good swimmer, and it's a little too soon...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.21,0:13:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我想对他来说还有点为时过早\N{\fnArial\fs30}for him to be out here unsupervised.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.97,0:13:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我向你保证, 他和我在一起会很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}MR. RAY: I can assure you, he's quite safe with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.78,0:14:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信他会的, 但是你有这么多学生…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure he is, but you have a large class...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.78,0:14:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,他可能在你没有注意到的情况下 就会脱离你的视线的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he can get lost from sight if you're not looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.65,0:14:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是说你没有注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not saying you're not looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.85,0:14:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是说你会大意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not saying you're not looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.88,0:14:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,噢, 糟了! 尼莫正在游向海面!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my gosh! Nemo's swimming out to sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.62,0:14:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,尼莫!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nemo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.29,0:14:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道你在干什么吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.03,0:14:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你会被卡住的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll get stuck out there...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.86,0:14:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我会在另一条鱼那么做之前把你抓住的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll have to get you before another fish does.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.46,0:14:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,快回来!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.33,0:14:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我说你现在回来!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said get back here now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.37,0:14:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,停下! 你再敢往前游一下…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! You take one more move, mister...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.24,0:14:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你敢!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you dare!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.14,0:14:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你敢把一只鳍放放在那船上…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you put one fin on that boat...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.25,0:14:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你在听我说吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you listening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.78,0:14:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,不要碰那个船-尼莫!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't touch the bo... Nemo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.45,0:14:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,他碰了那个大屁股了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He touched the butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.12,0:14:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你赶快用你的小尾巴给我游回来, 尼莫\N{\fnArial\fs30}You paddle your little taiI right back here, Nemo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.89,0:14:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这就对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.09,0:14:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你有大麻烦了, 年轻人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are in big trouble, young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.82,0:14:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你听见我说的了么, 大…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you hear me? Big...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.43,0:14:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 大… - 啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Big... - Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.76,0:14:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.63,0:14:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,老爸! 救我!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.74,0:15:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我来了, 尼莫!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming, Nemo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.01,0:15:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 啊! - 藏到我下面来, 孩子们!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Aah! - Get under me, kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.98,0:15:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,啊! 噢! 不!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah! Oh! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.41,0:15:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,老爸!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.14,0:15:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,老爸!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.78,0:15:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,噢! 尼莫!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Nemo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.09,0:15:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 尼莫!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unh. Nemo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.12,0:15:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,尼莫, 不! 尼莫!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nemo, no! Nemo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.79,0:15:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,尼莫! 尼莫! 不!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nemo! Nemo! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.67,0:15:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不!\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.20,0:15:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.44,0:15:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uhh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.11,0:15:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,尼莫! 尼莫!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nemo! Nemo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.86,0:15:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,哇! 坚持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.90,0:16:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,噢, 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.17,0:16:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不, 不, 不见了 不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, it's gone. It's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.81,0:16:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不, 不, 怎么会不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, it can't be gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.14,0:16:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不! 不! 尼莫!\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no! Nemo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.51,0:16:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,尼莫! 尼莫!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nemo! Nemo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.11,0:16:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,尼莫! 尼莫!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nemo! Nemo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.75,0:16:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不!\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.08,0:16:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,尼莫! 尼莫!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nemo! Nemo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.72,0:16:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不! 不, 求你了, 不!\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No, please, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.33,0:16:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不, 不!\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.46,0:16:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,有人看到一艘船了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has anybody seen a boat?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.50,0:16:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,求你们了! 一艘白色的船!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please! A white boat!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.37,0:16:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,他们带走了我的儿子!\N{\fnArial\fs30}They took my son!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.07,0:16:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我的儿子! 帮帮我, 求你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My son! Help me, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.57,0:16:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 小心! - 什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look out! - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.50,0:16:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh. Ohh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.94,0:16:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,噢, 噢, 噢 对不起 我没有看到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohh. Oh, oh. Sorry. I didn't see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.58,0:16:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 先生? 你还好吗? - 他不见了, 他不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sir? Are you OK? - He's gone, he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.91,0:16:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,好, 好 没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There, there. It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.38,0:16:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他不见了 - 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's gone. - It'll be OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.68,0:16:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不, 不 他们把他带走了 我必须要找到那艘船\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. They took him away. I have to find the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.29,0:16:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,船? 嘿, 我看到了一艘船\N{\fnArial\fs30}A boat? Hey, I've seen a boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.39,0:17:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你看到了? - 刚刚过去不久\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You have? - It passed by not too long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.73,0:17:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 白色的? - 嘿 我叫多莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A white one? - Hi. I'm Dory.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.13,0:17:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,在哪? 哪个方向?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where? Which way?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.36,0:17:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,噢, 噢, 噢 往那边去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, oh, oh. It went this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.56,0:17:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,往那边去了 跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It went this way. Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.00,0:17:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 谢谢你, 真是太谢谢你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Thank you, thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.40,0:17:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.53,0:17:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.16,0:17:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,等等!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.67,0:17:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你能不能别老跟着我? - 什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Will you quit it? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.81,0:17:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我想在这里游一会 海里这么大不够你游的吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to swim here. Ocean isn't big enough for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.61,0:17:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你有麻烦了, 伙计? 啊? 啊?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a problem, buddy? Huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.94,0:17:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你有麻烦了, 伙计? 啊? 啊?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a problem, buddy? Huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.84,0:17:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是? 是不是? 你想要我?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you? Do you? You want a piece of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.58,0:17:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,噢, 我好害怕啊, 那又怎么样?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh, I'm scared now. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.48,0:18:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 等一下 - 不要再跟着我, 好吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait a minute. - Stop following me, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.12,0:18:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,什么? 你在带我去找那艘船\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? You're showing me where the boat went.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.29,0:18:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,船? 嘿, 我看到了一艘船\N{\fnArial\fs30}A boat? Hey, I've seen a boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.12,0:18:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,它才经过没多久 它朝那边去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It passed by not too long ago. It went this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.36,0:18:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,它朝那边去了 跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It went this way. Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.80,0:18:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下 出什么事了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. What is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.96,0:18:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经告诉我船向什么方向去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You already told me which way the boat was going.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.30,0:18:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我说过了么? 噢, 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did? Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.54,0:18:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,如果这是什么玩笑的话, 这并不好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this is some kind of practical joke, it's not funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.87,0:18:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我是只小丑鱼 别想在我面前班门弄斧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know funny. I'm a clownfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.21,0:18:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,不, 不是的 我知道那不是玩笑 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's not. I know it's not. I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.64,0:18:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,看, 我有短期失忆症\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, I suffer from short-term memory loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.65,0:18:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,短期失忆症 我不信这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Short-term memory loss. I don't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.52,0:18:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不, 是真的 我几乎马上就会忘掉发生的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's true. I forget things almost instantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.42,0:18:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,是家庭遗传, 至少, 我是这么认为的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It runs in my family. At least, I think it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.42,0:18:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯, 嗯, 我家里人呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, hmm. Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.20,0:18:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,…要我帮忙吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.63,0:18:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你确实有毛病-真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's wrong with you... really.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.34,0:18:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你误了我的大事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wasting my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.24,0:18:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须要找到我的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to find my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.58,0:19:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.15,0:19:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 噢 - 那个, 嗨!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ohh. - Well, hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.18,0:19:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫布鲁斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Name's Bruce.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.25,0:19:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系 我理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right. I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.05,0:19:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么要相信一个鲨鱼, 对不对?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why trust a shark, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.86,0:19:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,那么, 这么晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's a couple of bites like you...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.00,0:19:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你们两个还出来做什么, 嗯?\N{\fnArial\fs30}doing out so late, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.70,0:19:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没干什么 我们甚至没出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not doing anything. We're not even out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.77,0:19:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了! 那么你们两个是否愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great! Then how'd you morsels...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.04,0:19:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,参加我举行的一个小型的集会呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}like to come to a little get-together I'm having?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.34,0:19:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你的意思是? 是派对吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean, like a party?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.58,0:19:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,是的, 很对 是派对 你怎么说?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, right. A party. What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.68,0:19:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢派对 那听起来很有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love parties. That sounds like fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.88,0:19:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,派对很有趣, 还很有诱惑力, 但是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parties are fun, and it's tempting, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.32,0:19:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,噢, 来吧, 我坚持要求你们参加\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on, I insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.26,0:19:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 既然那么重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK. That's all that matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.10,0:19:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿, 看, 气球 真是个派对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look, balloons. It is a party.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.30,0:19:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,哈哈哈哈! 请不要靠近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha ha ha ha! Mind your distance, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.67,0:19:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,那可不是闹着玩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those balloons can be a bit dodgy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.37,0:20:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,要是弄响了, 麻烦可就大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't want one of them to pop.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.71,0:20:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.42,0:20:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.62,0:20:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,安安! 小沉!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anchor! Chum!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.29,0:20:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你回来了, 布鲁斯 终于回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you are, Bruce. Finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.12,0:20:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有客人来了 - 真不是时候, 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We got company. - It's about time, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.83,0:20:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我们已经吃过饭了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've already gone through the snacks...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.69,0:20:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我们已经吃过饭了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've already gone through the snacks...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.33,0:20:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我还是饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm still starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.93,0:20:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我几乎饿得要发疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We almost had a feeding frenzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.17,0:20:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧, 让我们来解决他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's get this over with.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.14,0:20:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,好了, 那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.77,0:20:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,会议正式开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}The meeting has officially come to order.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.11,0:20:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们来宣读誓言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us all say the pledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.64,0:20:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我是一只好鲨鱼, 不是一只没有头脑只会吃的机器\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a nice shark, not a mindless eating machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.18,0:20:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我要改变这个形象…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I am to change this image...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.85,0:20:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须要从改变自我开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must first change myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.32,0:20:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,鱼类是朋友, 不是食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fish are friends, not food.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.09,0:20:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,除了那些臭海豚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except stinkin' dolphins.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.45,0:20:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,海豚 耶 他们自以为他们很可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dolphins. Yeah. They think they're so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.52,0:20:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,看我 我是一只会跳的小海豚\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Look at me. I'm a flippin' little dolphin.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.29,0:20:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我跳一个给你看吧 我不像吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Let me flip for you. Ain't I something?"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.99,0:21:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,那么, 接着 今天的会议到了第五个议程...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, then. Today's meeting is Step 5...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.63,0:21:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,带一个鱼朋友来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring a Fish Friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.33,0:21:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你们都把朋友带来了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you all have your friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.87,0:21:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我的到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.94,0:21:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿, 你好 - 你的呢, 小沉?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, there. - How about you, Chum?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.07,0:21:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,噢, 我…可能把我的朋友放错地方了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I... seem to have misplaced my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.21,0:21:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,那没什么, 小沉\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all right, Chum.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.61,0:21:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我有个感觉, 和鱼类做朋友确实很艰难\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a feeling this would be a difficult step.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.18,0:21:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我先借你一个朋友吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can help yourself to one of my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.75,0:21:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢了, 伙计 给小沉一个小朋友, 嗯?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, mate. A little chum for Chum, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.25,0:21:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我先来开始陈述\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll start the testimonies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.95,0:21:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你们好 我的名字叫布鲁斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello. My name is Bruce.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.22,0:21:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你好, 布鲁斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Bruce.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.52,0:21:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,从我最后吃鱼是三周前的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has been three weeks since my last fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.73,0:21:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我会履行承诺, 否则割我的鱼翅做粥\N{\fnArial\fs30}On my honor, or may I be chopped up and made into soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.20,0:21:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你给了我们莫大的鼓舞 - 阿门\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're an inspiration! - Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.20,0:21:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,好了, 然后 谁是下一个?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, then. Who's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.67,0:21:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我, 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pick me, pick me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.00,0:21:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 前排那位女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. The little Sheila down the front.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.91,0:21:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 喔! - 到这上面来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whoo! - Come on up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.94,0:21:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 我叫多莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. I'm Dory.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.84,0:21:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你好, 多莉 - 然后, 啊, 那个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello, Dory. - And, uh, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.28,0:21:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我不认为我曾经吃过鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think I've ever eaten a fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.48,0:21:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那真是奇迹 - 你太好了, 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's incredible. - Good on you, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.09,0:21:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我很高兴我心里的石头终于落地了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad I got that off my chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.16,0:22:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,好的, 还有没有人?\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, anyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.52,0:22:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么样, 伙计? 你有什么问题?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about you, mate? What's your problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.16,0:22:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我? 我没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me? I don't have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.43,0:22:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,噢, 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.83,0:22:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 否决 - 啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Denial. - Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.46,0:22:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,从你的名字开始说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just start with your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.33,0:22:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 啊, 你们好\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK. Uh, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.07,0:22:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫莫林 我是一只小丑鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Marlin. I'm a clownfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.21,0:22:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 小丑鱼? 真的吗? - 给我们讲个笑话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A clownfish? Really? - Tell us a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.28,0:22:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢笑话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love jokes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.04,0:22:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我只会讲一个很冷的笑话, 还算不错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I actually do know one that's pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.08,0:22:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,有一个软体动物…\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was this mollusk...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.15,0:22:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,他走着去找一个海参\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he walks up to a sea cucumber.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.52,0:22:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,通常, 他们都不说话, 海参…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Normally, they don't talk, sea cucumbers...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.39,0:22:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,但是在笑话里, 每个人都说话…\N{\fnArial\fs30}but in a joke, everyone talks...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.39,0:22:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,所以这个软体动物对那个海参说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}so the sea mollusk says to the cucumber...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.16,0:22:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,老爸!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.80,0:22:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,尼莫!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nemo!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.16,0:22:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,尼莫! 哈哈! 尼莫! 我没听明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nemo! Ha ha! Nemo! I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.23,0:22:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,作为一个小丑鱼, 他真的很冷\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a clownfish, he's not that funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.17,0:22:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不, 不, 不, 不 他是我的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no. He's my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.04,0:22:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,他被一个潜水员带走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was taken by these divers.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.14,0:22:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,噢, 我的天 你这只可怜的鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my. You poor fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.88,0:22:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,人类-以为他们拥有所有的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Humans... think they own everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.88,0:22:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,或许是美国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably American.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.18,0:22:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,现在, 有一位父亲-在寻找他的小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, there is a father... Looking for his little boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.18,0:23:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,现在, 有一位父亲-在寻找他的小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, there is a father... Looking for his little boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.35,0:23:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这些记号是什么意思?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do these markings mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.89,0:23:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我甚至不认识我的父亲!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never knew my father!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.25,0:23:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 拥抱一下 - 我们都在这陪着你呢, 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Group hug. - We're all mates here, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.69,0:23:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我看不懂人类的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't read human.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.96,0:23:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要找一个能看明白这个的鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to find a fish that can read this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.26,0:23:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿, 看看, 鲨鱼们 - 不, 不, 不, 多莉!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, look, sharks. - No, no, no, Dory!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.26,0:23:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 伙计们 伙计们 - 不, 多莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Guys, guys. - No, Dory.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.43,0:23:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我的 把它给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's mine. Give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.80,0:23:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,给我! 噢!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gimme! Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.30,0:23:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,噢, 对不起 你没事吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm sorry. Are you OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.37,0:23:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 噢, 噢, 噢 - 很对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ow, ow, ow. - I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.74,0:23:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的打到我耳朵了 你喜欢看到流血吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really clocked me there. Am I bleeding?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.91,0:23:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- 喔 - 噢, 噢, 噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ohh. - Ow, ow, ow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.84,0:23:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,多莉, 你还好吗-喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory, are you OK... Ohh.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.44,0:23:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,喔, 真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohh, that's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.25,0:23:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,喔, 味道好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohh, that's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.01,0:23:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,马上阻止!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Intervention!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.95,0:23:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 只要咬一口 - 一起抓住他, 伙计!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just a bite. - Hold it together, mate!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.59,0:23:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,记住, 布鲁斯, 鱼是朋友, 不是食物!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember, Bruce, fish are friends, not food!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.26,0:23:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 食物! - 多莉, 小心!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Food! - Dory, look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.36,0:23:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 食物! - 多莉, 小心!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Food! - Dory, look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.19,0:23:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 啊! - 我今天晚上有鱼吃了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Aah! - I'm having fish tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.80,0:23:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,要记住守则, 伙计!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember the steps, mate!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.43,0:23:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.00,0:23:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 啊! 哇! - 啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Aah! Whoa! - Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.20,0:23:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 只要一小口! - 啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just one bite! - Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.54,0:24:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,真是个好日子 吼!\N{\fnArial\fs30}G'day. Grr!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.35,0:24:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,没有出路了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no way out!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.65,0:24:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,一定会有逃出去的路的!\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's got to be a way to escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.62,0:24:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,是谁呀?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.95,0:24:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,多莉, 帮我找个出去的路!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory, help me find a way out!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.35,0:24:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,谁啊? 对不起 改天再来吧 我们逃命要紧呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Come back later. We're trying to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.12,0:24:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 应该有逃出去的路的! - 这有个东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's got to be a way out! - Here's something.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.53,0:24:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,"逃生舱" 我想知道那个是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Es-cap-e". I wonder what that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.30,0:24:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,真有趣 它跟"逃生"难道不是一个意思吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Funny. It's spelled just like "escape".
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.87,0:24:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们走 - 啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's go. - Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.17,0:24:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,布鲁斯来了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's Brucey!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.30,0:24:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下 你认识字吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. You can read?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.04,0:24:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我认识字吗? 对啊 我认识!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can read? That's right. I can read!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.07,0:24:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那么, 这个 给我念一念这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then, here. Read this now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.24,0:24:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 啊! - 喔!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Aah! - Ohh!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.24,0:24:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,他真的不是故意要这么做的 因为他想念父亲才变成这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}He really doesn't mean it. He never even knew his father.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.05,0:24:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不要从车上掉下去!\N{\fnArial\fs30}CHUM: Don't fall off the wagon!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.32,0:24:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 啊! - 啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Aah! - Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.35,0:24:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,噢, 不, 堵死了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, it's blocked!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.03,0:24:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不, 布鲁斯, 你要坚强\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Bruce, focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.36,0:24:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,关于布鲁斯的事很对不起, 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about Bruce, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.53,0:24:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,他真的是一个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's really a nice guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.23,0:24:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要那个面罩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to get that mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.50,0:24:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你要那个面罩? 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want that mask? OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.14,0:25:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不, 不, 不, 不, 不, 不, 不!\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.94,0:25:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,快, 抓住那个面罩!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick, grab the mask!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.85,0:25:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,噢, 不 布鲁斯?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. Bruce?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.21,0:25:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.15,0:25:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,快逃命吧!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Swim away! Swim away!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.45,0:25:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,喔, 聚会结束了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, is the party over?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.53,0:25:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.56,0:25:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,老爸?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.56,0:25:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,老爸?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.00,0:25:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,啊?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.54,0:25:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,啊! 啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah! Uhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.08,0:25:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.62,0:26:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 芭芭拉 - 啊-哈?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Barbara. - Uh-huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.59,0:26:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,请准备一下他的前牙牙冠好吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prep for his anterior crown, would you, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.46,0:26:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我还需要一些棉花球\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm going to need a few more cotton rolls.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.93,0:26:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}BARBARA: OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.30,0:26:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你好, 小伙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, little fella.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.07,0:26:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.30,0:26:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,呵呵呵! 很漂亮, 是不是?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heh heh heh! Beauty, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.50,0:26:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我在暗礁那里发现了这个小家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found that guy struggling for life...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.87,0:26:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他正在拚命挣扎, 于是我救了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}out on the reef, and I saved him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.61,0:26:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,那么, 麻醉剂已经生效了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, has that Novocaine kicked in yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.74,0:26:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我认为是的 我们可以开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}PATIENT: I think so. We're ready to roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.18,0:26:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,泡泡!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bubbles!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.68,0:26:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我的泡泡\N{\fnArial\fs30}My bubbles.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.32,0:26:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,他喜欢泡泡\N{\fnArial\fs30}He likes bubbles.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.72,0:26:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,啊! 喔! 不! 啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah! Ohh! No! Uhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.20,0:26:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 午安 - 啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bonjour. - Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.47,0:26:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,慢点, 小家伙 没有什么可以担心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slow down, little fella. There's nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.30,0:26:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他吓得要死 - 我想回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's scared to death. - I want to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.57,0:26:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你们知道我爸爸在哪吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know where my dad is?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.64,0:26:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的, 你爸爸可能已经回宠物店了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, your dad's probably back at the pet store.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.44,0:26:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,宠物店?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pet store?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.65,0:27:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊, 你知道, 像是, 我是来自…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you know, like, I'm from Bob's Fish Mart.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.38,0:27:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 宠物皇宫 - 鱼类超市\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pet Palace. - Fish-O-Rama.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.98,0:27:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- 邮购\N{\fnArial\fs30}- e-bay - MaiI order. - Ebay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.48,0:27:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那么, 你是哪来的? - 我从海里来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So, which one is it? - I'm from the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.22,0:27:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,啊, 大海 大海?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, the ocean. The ocean?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.19,0:27:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,啊! 啊! 啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah! Aah! Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.12,0:27:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,他还没有经过消毒 虾虾!\N{\fnArial\fs30}He hasn't been decontaminated. Jacques!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.86,0:27:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是 - 给他清洗一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oui. - Clean him!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.23,0:27:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oui.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.80,0:27:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 大海里来的 - 喔, 大海里来的 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ocean. - Ooh, la mer. Bon.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.07,0:27:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这样就行了 他干净了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Voila. He is clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.67,0:27:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 又大又蓝 那是个什么样子?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. The big blue. What's it like?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.98,0:27:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 又大又蓝? - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Big and blue? - I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.05,0:27:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你需要什么, 只要找你的飘飘阿姨就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there's anything you need, just ask your Auntie Deb.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.28,0:27:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我不在, 你可以和我的妹妹亮亮说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or if I'm not around, you can talk to my sister Flo.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.42,0:27:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 你好吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.22,0:27:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不要听我妹妹说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't listen to anything my sister says.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.79,0:27:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,她头脑有点问题 哈哈哈哈!\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's nuts. Ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.66,0:27:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,有现场直播\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a live one.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.79,0:27:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 听不见你说什么, 桃桃 - 又有现场直播了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can't hear you, Peach. - I said we got a live one.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.86,0:27:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好家伙, 噢, 好家伙 - 有什么看的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Boy, oh, boy. - What do we got?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.86,0:27:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,根管治疗-从X光片看…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Root canal... and by the looks of those x-rays...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.43,0:27:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,好像不太好办\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's not going to be pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.93,0:27:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.67,0:27:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 橡皮托放了吗? - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dam and clamp installed? - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.14,0:27:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他以前都用什么器械来钻的? - 鸡牌牙钻\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What did he use to open? - Gator-Glidden drill.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.97,0:28:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,他最近好像很热衷那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}He seems to favor that one lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.67,0:28:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我看不到了, 亮亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't see, Flo.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.64,0:28:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你有一点太-啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're getting a little too... Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.81,0:28:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,现在他在做施得氏的新技术\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now he's doing the SchiIder technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.05,0:28:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,他用的是15号牙挫\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's using a Hedstrom file.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.48,0:28:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是15号牙锉 那是10号牙锉\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not a Hedstrom file. That's a K-Flex.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.72,0:28:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,它的抛面像内肌 显然是一个15号牙锉\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has a teardrop cross-section. Clearly a Hedstrom.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.39,0:28:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不, 不, 是10号牙锉 - 15号牙锉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, no, K-Flex. - Hedstrom.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.92,0:28:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 10号牙锉 - 15号牙锉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- K-Flex! - Hedstrom!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.66,0:28:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我又飘起来了 快来帮帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}There I go. A little help, over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.83,0:28:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我来给他放气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go deflate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.06,0:28:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 去漱口\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Go ahead and rinse.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.27,0:28:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,噢, 人类的嘴真是个恶心的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, the human mouth is a disgusting place.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.04,0:28:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿, 祖哥 - 我错过什么了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Nigel. - What did I miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.01,0:28:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,根管治疗-非常精彩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Root canal... a doozy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.21,0:28:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,根管治疗? 他用什么来做的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Root canal? What did he use to open?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.88,0:28:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 鸡牌牙钻 - 他最喜欢那个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gator-Glidden drill. - He's favoring that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.94,0:28:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,希望他最后没有用剩下的填料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope he doesn't get surplus sealer at the portal terminus.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.98,0:28:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你好 这是谁? - 新朋友 哈哈哈!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello. Who's this? - New guy. Ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.12,0:28:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,那个牙科医生在大堡礁那把他带回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dentist took him off the reef.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.49,0:28:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,偷渡客? 咱们是邻居\N{\fnArial\fs30}An outie. From my neck of the woods, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.89,0:28:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我得罪你了, 还望间谅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry if I ever took a snap at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.42,0:28:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,鱼要游泳, 鸟要吃鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fish gotta swim, birds gotta eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.86,0:28:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿! 不, 不, 不, 不!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! No, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.59,0:28:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不是你吃的鱼 他们是我养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not your fish. They're my fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.23,0:28:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,快走 快, 嘘!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, go. Go on, shoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.37,0:29:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,噢, 相框碎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, the picture broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.07,0:29:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,这个是达拉 她是我的侄女\N{\fnArial\fs30}This here's Darla. She's my niece.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.17,0:29:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,她这周就8岁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's going to be eight this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.67,0:29:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿, 小家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, little fella.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.17,0:29:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,跟你的新妈妈问个好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say hello to your new mummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.97,0:29:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,她这个星期五就过来接你\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll be here Friday to pick you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.48,0:29:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你是她的生日礼物 嘘, 嘘, 嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're her present. Shh, shh, shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.34,0:29:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我们的小秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's our little secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.45,0:29:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,好了, 特克先生, 你还要等一会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Mr. Tucker, while that sets up...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.02,0:29:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我出去一下, 马上回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to see a man about a wallaby.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.82,0:29:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,噢, 达拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Darla.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.75,0:29:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了? 她怎么了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What's wrong with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.66,0:29:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,她一直晃那个袋子\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wouldn't stop shaking the bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.39,0:29:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 可怜的查克斯 - 他是她去年的礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Poor Chuckles. - He was her present last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.20,0:29:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,死后被丢进了马桶里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hitched a ride on the porcelain express.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.43,0:29:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,她是个金鱼杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a fish killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.67,0:29:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我不要和那个女孩走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't go with that girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.97,0:29:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我要回到我爸爸身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to get back to my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.77,0:29:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,啊! 爸爸! 救我!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah! Daddy! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.71,0:29:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,噢, 他被卡住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, he's stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.91,0:29:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,谁都不要碰他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody touch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.38,0:29:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,谁都不要碰他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody touch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.09,0:29:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你能帮我吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.56,0:29:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不能, 你自己钻到了那里面去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You got yourself in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.93,0:30:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不能, 你自己钻到了那里面去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You got yourself in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.59,0:30:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你就要自己从那里出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can get yourself out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.30,0:30:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 吉哥 - 我想看着他自己做\N{\fnArial\fs30}- GiIl... - I want to see him do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.60,0:30:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,冷静, 按相反方向摆动你的鳍和尾巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calm down. Alternate wiggling your fins and your taiI.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.47,0:30:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我不行, 我的鳍太弱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't. I have a bad fin.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.30,0:30:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,那又怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never stopped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.54,0:30:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,只要想想你需要怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just think about what you need to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.08,0:30:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,加油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.82,0:30:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.06,0:30:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 耶! - 你成功了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yay! - You did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.46,0:30:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,做得很好 哈哈哈!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good squirming. Ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.26,0:30:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,喔 他来自大海-就像你一样, 吉哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. From the ocean... just like you, Gill.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.90,0:30:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.10,0:30:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我曾经见过你这个表情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen that look before.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.50,0:30:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你在想什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you thinking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.20,0:30:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我在想…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thinking...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.01,0:30:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,今天晚上, 我们要给这个孩子来一个适当的接待\N{\fnArial\fs30}tonight, we give the kid a proper reception.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.61,0:30:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,那么, 孩子, 你有名字什么的吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, kid, you got a name or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.31,0:30:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,尼莫 我叫尼莫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nemo. I'm Nemo.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.15,0:30:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,尼莫 尼莫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nemo. Nemo.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.82,0:31:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你要吃那个吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna eat that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.07,0:31:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 小心那个锤子 - 啊?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Careful with that hammer. - Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.24,0:31:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不, 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.05,0:31:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,上面是怎么说的? 多莉!\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does it say? Dory!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.31,0:31:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,一个海怪拿了我的钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}A sea monkey has my money.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.98,0:31:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,醒醒 起来, 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up. Get up. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.28,0:31:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,快点!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.29,0:31:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是的, 我生来就是蓝色的 - 起来!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, I'm a natural blue. - Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.55,0:31:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,小心! 鲨鱼吃鱼的! 啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out! Sharks eat fish! Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.93,0:31:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 啊! - 啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Aah! - Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.97,0:31:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.88,0:32:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,喔, 都是灰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. Dusty.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.98,0:32:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,面罩 面罩哪去了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mask. Where's the mask?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.19,0:32:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不! 不, 不要!\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No, not the mask!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.12,0:32:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,抓住它! 抓住那个面罩! 抓住那个面罩! 抓住它!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it! Get the mask! Get the mask! Get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.36,0:32:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,喔-呼!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.40,0:32:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,它就那么掉下去了, 是不是?\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just keeps going on, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.17,0:32:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,有回音! 回音!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Echo! Echo!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.60,0:32:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿, 你在干什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.87,0:32:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不见了 我丢了那个面罩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gone. I've lost the mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.17,0:32:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你把它丢了? - 是你弄丢掉的!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you drop it? - You dropped it!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.24,0:32:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我找到我儿子的唯一机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was my only chance of finding my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.88,0:32:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,现在它不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now it's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.78,0:32:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿, 坏脾气先生…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Mr. Grumpy Gills...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.69,0:32:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,当生活让你失望的时候, 知道你要做什么吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}when life gets you down, know what you got to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.32,0:32:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不想知道 - 继续游下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't want to know. - Just keep swimming.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.79,0:32:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 继续游下去,游下去,游下去 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Just keep swimming, swimming, swimming... ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.26,0:32:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我们该怎么做? 我们继续游, 继续游 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ What do we do? We swim, swim ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.53,0:32:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,多莉, 不要唱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory, no singing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.63,0:32:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我爱游泳 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I love to swim ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.27,0:32:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 当你想游的时候 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ When you want to swim ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.74,0:32:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,知道吗, 我被那个歌弄得心烦意乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, I'm going to get stuck now with that song.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.77,0:33:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 现在我头都大了 - 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now it's in my head. - Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.01,0:33:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,多莉, 你看到什么了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory, do you see anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.48,0:33:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 啊! 有东西抓住我了 - 那是我, 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Aah! Something's got me. - That was me. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.25,0:33:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是谁? - 还能是谁? 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who's that? - Who could it be? It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.65,0:33:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你是我的灵魂吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you my conscience?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.95,0:33:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,是的, 是的 我是你的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah. I'm your conscience.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.62,0:33:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,好久不见 你还好吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}We haven't spoken for a while. How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.56,0:33:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不告诉你 - 耶? 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can't complain. - Yeah? Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.86,0:33:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,现在, 多莉, 我想要你告诉我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Dory, I want you to tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.63,0:33:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你能看到东西吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you see anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.40,0:33:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到…我看到亮光了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see a... I see a light.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.03,0:33:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 亮光? - 是的, 就在那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A light? - Yeah. Over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.64,0:33:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿, 灵魂, 我死了吗? - 不, 我也看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, conscience, am I dead? - No. I see it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.78,0:33:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.82,0:33:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这真是太漂亮了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.66,0:33:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我感到…很温暖…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm feeling... happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.49,0:33:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这对我来说真是太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is a big deal for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.03,0:33:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我想摸摸它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to touch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.57,0:34:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 噢 - 噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh. - Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.13,0:34:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿, 回来 回到这来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, come back. Come on back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.57,0:34:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我要追上你 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I'm gonna get you ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.17,0:34:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我要抓到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.97,0:34:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我要和你一起游 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I'm gonna swim with you ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.27,0:34:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我要抓到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.68,0:34:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我要做你最好的朋友 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I'm gonna be your best friend ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.58,0:34:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,温暖的感觉消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good feeling's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.38,0:34:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哇! - 哇哈!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whoa! - Waah!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.59,0:34:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我看不到了! 我不知道我在往哪游!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't see! I don't know where I'm going!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.39,0:34:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,啊哈!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haah!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.36,0:34:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,啊哈!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haah!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.26,0:34:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 面具! - 什么面罩?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The mask! - What mask?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.26,0:34:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这下好了, 我什么都看不到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, I can't see a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.96,0:34:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 噢, 快 - 嘿, 看, 面罩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, gee. - Hey, look, a mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.30,0:34:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,快读!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Read it!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.00,0:34:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起, 如果你能…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, but if you could just...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.67,0:34:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,把那个拿近一些, 我需要一些灯光\N{\fnArial\fs30}bring it a little closer, I kind of need the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.20,0:34:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,把那个拿近一些, 我需要一些灯亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring it a little closer, I kind of need the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.64,0:34:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了 把它放在那吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's great. Keep it right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.61,0:34:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快念! - 好的, 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just read it! - OK, OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.38,0:34:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天! 啊, "P"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Bossy. Uh, "P".
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.45,0:34:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 "P·歇尔…"\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK. "P. Sher..."
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.45,0:34:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,"歇尔... P·歇尔..."\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Sher... P. Sher... P. Shirley? P..."
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.45,0:34:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 第一行是 "P·歇尔曼"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. The first line's "P. Sherman".
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.79,0:34:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,"P·歇尔曼" 根本没什么用啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}"P. Sherman" doesn't make any sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.03,0:35:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 第二行 "42号"\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK. Second line. "42".
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.29,0:35:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不要吃我 不要吃我 啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't eat me. Don't eat me. Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.00,0:35:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,请不要关灯!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Light, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.97,0:35:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,"袋鼠, 袋鼠... "\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Walla... walla..."
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.57,0:35:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,哇! 哇! 哇!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Waah! Waah! Waah!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.51,0:35:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,第二行是 "袋鼠街42号"\N{\fnArial\fs30}The second line's "42 Wallaby Way".
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.31,0:35:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了 快念, 快把它念完\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's great. Speed read. Take a guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.14,0:35:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不要有压力 没事的 压力已经够多的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No pressure. No problem. There's a lot of pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.81,0:35:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,压力来了! 现在有压力了快念完它!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pressure! Take a guess now with pressure!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.38,0:35:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- "悉尼"! 是"悉尼"! - 快闪!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "Sydney"! It's "Sydney"! - Duck!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.52,0:35:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.49,0:35:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我死了 我死了, 我死了, 我死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm dead. I'm dead, I'm dead, I'm dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.92,0:35:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经死了 我死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I died. I'm dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.30,0:35:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,喔-呼!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.67,0:35:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我们成功了, 我们成功了 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ We did it, we did it ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.50,0:35:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 哦, 耶, 耶, 耶 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Oh, yeah, yeah, yeah ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.24,0:35:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 今天晚上不会被吃, 喔! ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ No eating here tonight, whoo! ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.11,0:35:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 不会被吃 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Eating here tonight ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.51,0:35:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 不会, 不会, 不会被吃 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ No, no, no, eating here tonight ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.84,0:35:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 多莉 - 你需要节食\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dory. - You on a diet...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.34,0:35:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,多莉! 面罩上怎么说的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory! What did the mask say?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.21,0:35:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,悉尼袋鼠大街42号, P . 歇尔曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}P. Sherman, 42 Wallaby Way, Sydney.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.08,0:35:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我记住上面是怎么说的了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remembered what it said!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.25,0:35:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我通常都会忘掉, 但是这次我记住了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I usually forget things, but I remembered it!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.79,0:36:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,哇, 哇, 等等 那是哪?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, wait. Where is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.49,0:36:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道 但是谁在乎呢? 我记住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. But who cares? I remembered.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.96,0:36:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哇! - 啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Raar! - Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.19,0:36:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,悉尼袋鼠大街42号, P . 歇尔曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}P. Sherman, 42 Wallaby Way, Sydney.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.46,0:36:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我又能记住了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remembered it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.19,0:36:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,尼莫\N{\fnArial\fs30}JACQUES: Psst. Nemo.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.23,0:36:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.86,0:36:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 尼莫 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Nemo ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.60,0:36:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哈? - 跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Huh? - Suivez-moi.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.60,0:36:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.73,0:37:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,说出你的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}State your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.50,0:37:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,尼莫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nemo.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.63,0:37:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,祖祖, 该你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brother Bloat, proceed.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.10,0:37:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,尼莫, 橙底白条初来乍到者…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nemo, newcomer of orange and white...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.04,0:38:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,鱼缸水波兄弟会\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have been called forth...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.44,0:38:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,今天在华拿忽克啊骆鸡山\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the summit of Mount Wannahockaloogie...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.04,0:38:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,特邀你上山落草为寇, 永结同心\N{\fnArial\fs30}to join with us in the fraternal bonds of tankhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.38,0:38:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哈? - 我们欢迎你, 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Huh? - We want you in our club, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.32,0:38:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真的? - 除非…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really? - Lf...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.55,0:38:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你能游过…\N{\fnArial\fs30}you are able to swim through...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.86,0:38:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,火焰之环!\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Ring of Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.83,0:38:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,打开火焰之环!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn on the Ring of Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.70,0:38:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你说你来做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you could do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.37,0:38:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,火焰之环!\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Ring of Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.34,0:38:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,泡泡, 让我-噢!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bubbles, let me... Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.05,0:38:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,没有其他的方式了吗? 他只是个孩子!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't there another way? He's just a boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.53,0:38:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,从这一刻起, 你就叫做鲨鱼饵\N{\fnArial\fs30}From this moment on, you will be known as Sharkbait.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.67,0:39:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,鲨鱼饵, 呼-哈-哈!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharkbait, oo-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.03,0:39:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎你, 鲨鱼饵兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome, Brother Sharkbait.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.84,0:39:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,鲨鱼饵, 呼-哈-哈!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharkbait, oo-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.10,0:39:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 已经够了 - 鲨鱼饵\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Enough with the Sharkbait. - Sharkbait!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.17,0:39:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.07,0:39:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,鲨鱼饵已经是我们中的一员了, 同意吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharkbait's one of us now, agreed?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.68,0:39:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 同意 - 我们不能让他去送死\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Agreed. - We can't send him to his death.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.78,0:39:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,达拉五天之内就会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darla's coming in five days.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.91,0:39:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,那么, 我们要怎么办?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what are we going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.52,0:39:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我会告诉你 我们要怎么做...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you what we're gonna do...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.12,0:39:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我们帮它逃离这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're gonna get him out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.72,0:39:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们要帮他逃走 - 逃走? 真的吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We'll help him escape. - Escape? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.29,0:39:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都要逃走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all gonna escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.79,0:39:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,吉哥, 求你了 不要再弄逃生方案了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gill, please. Not another escape plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.46,0:39:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起, 那些都没什么作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, but they just never work.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.53,0:39:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这次会有什么区别么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why should this be any different?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.66,0:39:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这次会有什么区别么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why should this be any different?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.10,0:39:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 因为这次我们有他 - 我?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Because we've got him. - Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.60,0:39:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你看到那个过滤器了么? - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You see that fiIter? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.37,0:39:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你是唯一的一个可以进去再出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the only one who can get in and out of that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.84,0:39:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要你把一个小鹅卵石弄进去…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need you to take a pebble inside there...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.04,0:39:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,来卡住传动装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}and jam the gears.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.31,0:39:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我们那么做, 这个水缸就会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do that, and this tank's gonna get...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.31,0:39:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,随着时间的流逝越来越脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}filthier and filthier by the minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.31,0:39:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,用不了多长时间, 那个牙医就得清理这个水缸…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty soon, the dentist'll have to clean the tank...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.68,0:39:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,当他要这么做的时候, 他就要把我们拿出水缸…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and when he does, he'll take us out of the tank...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.62,0:39:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,把我们放在单独的袋子里…\N{\fnArial\fs30}put us in individual baggies...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.22,0:39:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我们就把我们自己滚下柜台…\N{\fnArial\fs30}then we'll roll ourselves down the counter...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.06,0:39:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,出了窗户, 掉下遮阳蓬…\N{\fnArial\fs30}out the window, off the awning...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.76,0:39:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,进入灌木丛, 穿过街道…\N{\fnArial\fs30}into the bushes, across the street...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.46,0:40:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,然后进入港口!\N{\fnArial\fs30}and into the harbor!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.96,0:40:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这是万无一失的 谁跟我一起来?\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's foolproof. Who's with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.93,0:40:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我! - 我!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Aye! - Aye!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.37,0:40:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我认为你们脑袋都秀逗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you're nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.97,0:40:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,恕我冒犯, 孩子, 但是你游泳实在差劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}No offense, kid, but you're not the best swimmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.84,0:40:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,他没问题 他能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's fine. He can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.27,0:40:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,那么, 鲨鱼饵? 你怎么想?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Sharkbait, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.78,0:40:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就这么干吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.72,0:40:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我要去悉尼袋鼠大街42号, P . 歇尔曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to P. Sherman, 42 Wallaby Way, Sydney.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.72,0:40:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你要去哪?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.05,0:40:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我要去悉尼袋鼠大街42号, 找歇尔曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to P. Sherman, 42 Wallaby Way, Sydney.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.75,0:40:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你问我要去哪…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you ask where I'm going...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.42,0:40:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我就告诉你那就是我要去的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you that's where I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.19,0:40:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,那是悉尼袋鼠大街42号, 找歇尔曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's P. Sherman, 42 Wallaby Way, Sydney.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.69,0:40:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,哪? 对不起 我听不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where? I'm sorry, I didn't hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.49,0:40:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,悉尼袋鼠大街42号, 找歇尔曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}P. Sherman, 42 Wallaby Way, Sydney.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.10,0:40:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.93,0:40:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 你们知道怎么去...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. Do you know how to get...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.77,0:40:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你们好? 哇 等一下 你们能告诉我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? Whoa. Wait. Can you tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.77,0:40:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿! 停下! 我想问你们个问题!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hold it! I'm trying to talk to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.14,0:40:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们, 回到这来 很快就问完\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fellas, come back here. One quick question.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.55,0:40:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要-他们又走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to... And they're gone again.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.98,0:40:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,悉尼袋鼠大街42号, 找 P . 歇尔曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}P. Sherman, 42 Wallaby Way, Sydney.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.78,0:41:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么我要一次又一次的告诉你?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do I have to tell you over and over again?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.49,0:41:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我再告诉你一次 我还没有厌烦...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you again. I don't get tired of it...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.52,0:41:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好吧, 那好吧 - 啊?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- OK, all right. - Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.72,0:41:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是这样 - 啊-哈?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here's the thing. - Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.46,0:41:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我认为最好我能继续…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's best if I carry on from here by...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.00,0:41:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,一个人走的好\N{\fnArial\fs30}by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.40,0:41:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.63,0:41:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你知道, 一个人 - 啊-哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know, alone. - Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.37,0:41:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,没有-没有-我是说, 不想再和你一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without... without... I mean, not without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.44,0:41:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我不想你…跟着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't want you... with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.84,0:41:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 啊? - 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Huh? - Am I...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.21,0:41:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想伤害你的感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to hurt your feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.41,0:41:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你要我走? - 我的意思是, 不-是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You want me to leave? - I mean, not... Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.25,0:41:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是不能再有任何的耽搁了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just can't afford any more delays...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.72,0:41:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,而你是那种能让人耽搁的鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're one of those fish that cause delays.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.95,0:41:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,有的时候那是件好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes it's a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.62,0:41:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,有一大群鱼, 他们都是那种拖拖拉拉的鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a whole group of fish. They're delay fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.69,0:41:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你的意思是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.29,0:41:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你的意思是你不喜欢我?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean you don't like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.99,0:41:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不, 当然我喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, of course I like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.83,0:41:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,那是因为我喜欢你所以我才不想你和我一起走\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's because I like you I don't want to be with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.56,0:41:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,那是种复杂的感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a complicated emotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.77,0:41:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 噢! - 不要哭 我喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ohh! - Don't cry. I like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.50,0:41:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿, 你! 女士, 这个家伙找你的麻烦吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you! Lady, is this guy bothering you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.91,0:41:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯…我不记得了 你做过么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um... I don't remember. Were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.88,0:41:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,不, 不, 不, 不, 不 我们只是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, no. We're just...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.81,0:42:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你们知道我怎么才能到...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you guys know how I can get to...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.61,0:42:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,看, 伙计, 我们在和女士说话, 不是跟你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, pal, we're talking to the lady, not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.98,0:42:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿, 嘿 你喜欢模仿秀么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey. You like impressions?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.62,0:42:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯-哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.69,0:42:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,要像预演的时候一样, 先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like in rehearsals, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.06,0:42:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,那么我们是什么? 猜一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what are we? Take a guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.66,0:42:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,哦, 哦 我曾经见过一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, oh. I've seen one of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.99,0:42:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我是条长着利剑般鼻子的鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a fish with a nose like a sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.23,0:42:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 等等 - 是剑鱼!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait, wait, um... - It's a swordfish!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.23,0:42:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿, 小丑鱼, 让那女士猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, clown boy, let the lady guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.00,0:42:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿, 小丑鱼, 让那女士猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, clown boy, let the lady guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.30,0:42:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,先生们, 谁需要奶油?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the butter?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.90,0:42:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,啊! 就在嘴边!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh! It's on the tip of my tongue!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.34,0:42:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 龙虾 - 看这儿!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lobster. - Saw that!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.37,0:42:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,有很多爪, 并且生活在海里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lots of legs! Live in the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.24,0:42:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 安静! - 时间到!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Clam! - Close enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.67,0:42:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,一个关于鲸鱼的传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's a whale of a tale...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.21,0:42:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我会跟你讲的, 嗯…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you, lad...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.71,0:42:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.75,0:42:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,有人愿意为我指一下路吗? !\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will somebody please give me directions? !
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.08,0:42:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,"有人愿意为我指一下路吗? ! ? !"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Will somebody please give me directions? !"
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.48,0:42:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哈哈! - 我是认真的!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ha ha ha ha ha! - I'm serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.55,0:42:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,呐呐呐, 呢呢呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Blah blah blah, me, me, blah!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.59,0:42:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,呐呐呐呐, 呢呢呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Blah blah blah, me, me, me!"
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.82,0:42:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.36,0:42:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,啊, 亲爱的 嘿! 嘿, 回来!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, dear. Hey! Hey, come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.89,0:42:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿, 什么事? - 什么事?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, what's the matter? - What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.03,0:42:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿, 什么事? - 什么事?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, what's the matter? - What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.59,0:42:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,当他们在做着那些愚蠢的模仿秀时…\N{\fnArial\fs30}While they're doing their siIly little impressions...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.60,0:42:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我正远离家乡 守着一条我连名字都记不起的傻鱼!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am miles from home with a fish that can't remember her name!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.77,0:42:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我想这真是令人沮丧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet that's frustrating.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.10,0:42:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,而且, 我儿子还下落不明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meanwhile, my son is out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.57,0:42:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你的儿子吉莫? - 是尼莫?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your son Chico? - Nemo?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.61,0:43:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,但也只能这样了 因为整个大海里…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it doesn't matter because no fish...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.04,0:43:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,都没有一条鱼肯帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}in this entire ocean is going to help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.04,0:43:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯, 我会帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm helping you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.85,0:43:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,在这儿等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.42,0:43:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗨! 伙计们 - 他又在烦你吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Guys! - Is he bothering you again?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.05,0:43:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,没有 他是好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. He's a good guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.62,0:43:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,对他好点 他的儿子走失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go easy on him. He's lost his son Fabio.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.62,0:43:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,对他好点 他的儿子法比欧走失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go easy on him. He's lost his son Fabio.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.89,0:43:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你听说过悉尼袋鼠路42号 P . 歇尔曼吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any of you heard of P. Sherman, 42 Wallaby Way, Sydney?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.86,0:43:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,悉尼? 啊, 当然!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sydney? Oh, sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.53,0:43:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这儿的特克在悉尼有亲戚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ted here's got relatives in Sydney.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.30,0:43:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不是吗, 特克? - 当然有!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't you, Ted? - Sure do!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.96,0:43:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,啊! 嘿! 他们知道悉尼!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Hey! They know Sydney!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.70,0:43:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你不知道去那里的路, 是吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't know how to get there, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.24,0:43:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我会跟着东流一直走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to follow the E. A. C.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.24,0:43:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,就是东澳洲暖流\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the East Australian Current.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.97,0:43:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,很大的洋流 不会找不到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big current. Can't miss it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.64,0:43:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,它现在是…朝那方向流的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in... that direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.64,0:43:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你跟着洋流走大约…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then you follow that for about...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.58,0:43:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道 你们认为呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. What do you guys think?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.38,0:43:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,大约十海里吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}About three leagues?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.58,0:43:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,它正好能把你们带到悉尼的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That little baby will put you right past Sydney.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.59,0:43:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢! - 太好了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ta-da! - That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.05,0:43:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,多莉, 谢谢!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory, you did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.29,0:43:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,啊, 别这样, 我是你的小助手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, please, I'm just your little helper.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.16,0:43:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 一路帮忙 就是我 - 伙计们, 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Helping along. That's me. - Fellas, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.53,0:43:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,别客气! 放轻松, 好吗, 伙计?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't mention it! Just loosen up, OK, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.20,0:44:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,啊, 你们这些伙计 你们说到点子上了 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you guys. You really nailed him. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.23,0:44:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,啊, 嘿, 女士 还有一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hey, ma'am. One more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.10,0:44:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,当你遇到这条海沟时, 从下面游过去, 别从上面过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you come to this trench, swim through it, not over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.71,0:44:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,海沟…从下面过, 别从上面过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trench... through it, not over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.64,0:44:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我记住了 嘿, 嘿!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll remember. Hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.78,0:44:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿, 等等, 伙伴! 等等!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, wait up, partner! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.08,0:44:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,等等! 我有话要说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait! I gotta tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.85,0:44:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.59,0:44:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,好漂亮的海沟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice trench.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.62,0:44:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你好!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.33,0:44:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好, 出发 - 不, 不 我看这海沟有点玄\N{\fnArial\fs30}- OK, let's go. - No, no. Bad trench.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.00,0:44:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,快点, 我们还是从上面游过这东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, we'll swim over this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.70,0:44:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨, 搭档, 上面肯定不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, partner. Little red flag going up.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.87,0:44:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我记得好像有谁说过, 只能走下面不能走上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's telling me to swim through it, not over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.54,0:44:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿, 我说你没有长眼睛吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you looking at this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.21,0:44:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,要是从下面过, 那你就死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got death written all over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.74,0:44:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的, 真的, 真的 认为我们应该从下面穿过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really, really, really think we should swim through.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.61,0:44:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,而我真的, 真的认为不应该走下面 从上面过吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm really, really done talking about this. Over we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.88,0:44:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 相信我 - 相信你?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Trust me on this. - Trust you?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.88,0:44:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,是的, 信任 朋友之间就该这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, trust. It's what friends do.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.79,0:44:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧! 有东西在发光!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look! Something shiny!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.72,0:44:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哪儿? - 就在下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where? - It just swam over the trench.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.52,0:45:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快点, 我们跟上来! - 好吧!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, we'll follow it! - OK!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.23,0:45:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐, 这什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy, it sure is clear up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.93,0:45:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 瞧-是洋流\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly. And look at that... there's the current.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.43,0:45:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一分钟也不能耽搁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should be there in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.07,0:45:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿, 小家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, little guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.91,0:45:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你当时还说什么从下面游过那个海沟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanted to go through the trench.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.71,0:45:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我应该叫他柔柔, 他是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall call him Squishy, and he shall be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.78,0:45:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,他将是我的小宝贝 过来, 小柔柔\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he shall be my Squishy. Come here, Squishy.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.04,0:45:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,过来, 小柔柔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here, little Squishy.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.29,0:45:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,噢！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.55,0:45:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是水母! - 你是个坏柔柔!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's a jellyfish! - Bad Squishy!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.45,0:45:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,嘘, 嘘! 快走开!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoo, shoo! Get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.29,0:45:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 让我瞧瞧 - 别碰它\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let me see that. - Don't touch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.62,0:45:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会碰它的 我只是想瞧瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't touch it. I just want to look.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.99,0:45:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿! 它怎么不刺你啊?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! How come it didn't sting you?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.06,0:45:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,刺了 只不过…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It did. It's just that...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.63,0:45:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哦 哦 哦 - 别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ow! Ow! Ow! - Hold still.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.36,0:45:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我生活在海葵区…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I live in this anemone...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.87,0:45:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,经常被刺, 已经习惯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm used to these kind of stings.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.77,0:45:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,噢噢噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow! Ow! Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.97,0:45:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,看上去还不太糟 你会好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't look bad. You'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.00,0:45:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,但现在我们应该学乖一点了, 我们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now we know, don't we...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.77,0:45:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不要再碰这些东西了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we don't want to touch these again.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.01,0:45:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我们很幸运, 这次只是个小家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's be thankful this time it was just a little one.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.08,0:45:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 啊 - 啊 \N{\fnArial\fs30}- Aah! - Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.51,0:45:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.62,0:45:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这下可坏了, 多莉 - 嘿, 瞧!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is bad, Dory. - Hey, watch this!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.42,0:46:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 糟透了, 多莉 - 嘿, 瞧!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is bad, Dory. - Hey, watch this!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.56,0:46:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,乒乒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boing! Boing!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.25,0:46:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,多莉!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.52,0:46:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你碰不到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't catch me...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.89,0:46:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,别在上面跳!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't bounce on the tops!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.39,0:46:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,它不…刺你? !\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will... not sting you!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.56,0:46:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 上面是不会刺你的! - 一次跳两个呀! 打呀!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The tops don't sting you! - Two in a row! Beat that!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.27,0:46:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,多莉, 听我说 我有个主意-来玩一个游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory, listen to me. I have an idea... a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.24,0:46:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 一个游戏? - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A game? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.80,0:46:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我喜欢游戏! 我参加! - 游戏是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I love games! Pick me! - Here's the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.51,0:46:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,谁最快跳离这些水母, 谁就赢!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever can hop the fastest out of these jellyfish wins!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.01,0:46:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好 - 规则是, 规则是, 规则是!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- OK. - Rules, rules, rules!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.68,0:46:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你不得碰这些触角 只能碰上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't touch the tentacles. Only the tops.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.28,0:46:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不碰就不碰, 知道了 出发!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something about tentacles. Got it. Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.18,0:46:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,等等! 千万不能碰!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! Not something about 'em, it's all about 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.15,0:46:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哇 - 等等, 多莉!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whee! - Wait, Dory!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.39,0:46:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,如果想赢, 你得再快点!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta go faster if you want to win!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.09,0:46:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,如果想赢, 你得再快点!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta go faster if you want to win!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.52,0:46:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,哇! 多莉!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! Dory!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.73,0:46:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,乒乒乒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boing, boing, boing!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.73,0:46:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,等等! 多莉!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute! Whoa! Dory!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.63,0:46:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whee!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.20,0:46:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这简直是在玩命啊 我们是在和死神赛跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're cheating death now. That's what we're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.50,0:46:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们却乐在其中\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we're having fun at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.20,0:46:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我行的 但要小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can do this. Just be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.67,0:46:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,是的, 小心, 我赢了你别哭!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, careful I don't make you cry when I win!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.61,0:46:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,哭的是你!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.81,0:46:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,哈哈哈哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.37,0:46:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,哇!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.21,0:46:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,放弃吧, 老家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it up, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.41,0:47:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我天生就是小飞侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't fight evolution. I was buiIt for speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.71,0:47:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,问题是, 多莉, 你饿吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}The question is, Dory, are you hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.72,0:47:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 饿? - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hungry? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.08,0:47:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你要是饿就吃我的泡泡吧!\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause you're about to eat my bubbles!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.85,0:47:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,向左下潜! 就这里!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Duck to the left! Right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.39,0:47:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,小丑鱼赢了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}The clownfish is the winner!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.86,0:47:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我们成功了! 瞧我们!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo-hoo! We did it! Look at us!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.96,0:47:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,多莉?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.72,0:47:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,啊, 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.19,0:47:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,多莉! 多莉!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory! Dory!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.53,0:47:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,多莉!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.60,0:47:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,多莉!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.87,0:47:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohh!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.01,0:47:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我输了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I disqualified?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.78,0:47:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不, 你干得很好! 实际上你赢了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're doing fine! You're actually winning!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.78,0:47:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,但你得保持清醒 P . 歇尔曼住在哪里?\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you gotta stay awake. Where does P. Sherman live?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.95,0:47:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,P . 歇尔曼… 悉尼 袋鼠路…\N{\fnArial\fs30}P. Sherman... Wallaby Way, Sydney...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.88,0:47:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,对了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.69,0:47:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.89,0:47:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 袋鼠路… - 保持清醒!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wallaby Way... - Uhh! Stay awake!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.62,0:47:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,保持清醒! 啊! 保持清醒!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay awake! Ooh! Stay awake!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.96,0:47:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,保持…清醒!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay... awake!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.27,0:48:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 醒醒 - P . 歇尔曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Awake. - P. Sherman.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.57,0:48:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 醒醒 - 袋鼠路 42 号\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Awake. - 42 Wallaby Way.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.60,0:48:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,醒醒 尼莫…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up. Nemo...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.17,0:48:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,醒醒 尼莫…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up. Nemo...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.29,0:48:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,鲨鱼饵, 想你老爸了, 是吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You miss your dad, don't you, Sharkbait?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.69,0:48:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.56,0:48:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.09,0:48:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你可真幸运, 外面有人在找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lucky to have someone out there looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.13,0:48:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,他不会找我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not looking for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.33,0:48:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,他害怕大海\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's scared of the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.74,0:48:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,桃桃, 有什么情况?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peach, any movement?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.37,0:48:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,他已经喝了至少四杯咖啡了 我看快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's had four cups of coffee. It's gotta be soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.31,0:48:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,继续监视住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.25,0:48:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我第一次逃跑-结果掉到了牙钻上\N{\fnArial\fs30}My first escape... landed on dental tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.11,0:48:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我本来想跳到马桶的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was aiming for the toilet.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.58,0:48:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,马桶?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toilet?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.82,0:48:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,条条水管通大海, 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}All drains lead to the ocean, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.45,0:48:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你曾试图逃跑了多少次?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. How many times have you tried to get out?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.76,0:49:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经记不清了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, I've lost count.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.39,0:49:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,鱼类不应该养在鱼缸里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fish aren't meant to be in a box, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.36,0:49:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,久了头脑会有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}It does things to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.06,0:49:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,泡泡!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bubbles! Bubbles!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.23,0:49:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,洗手间! 洗手间! 他拿起了《读者文摘》\N{\fnArial\fs30}Potty break! He grabbed the "Reader's Digest".
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.63,0:49:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们有4分20秒! - 看你的了, 鲨鱼饵\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We have 4. 2 minutes! - That's your cue, Sharkbait.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.07,0:49:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你能行的, 孩子 - 我们得快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can do it, kid. - We gotta be quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.41,0:49:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,一好了, 我们长话短说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once you get in, swim to the bottom of the chamber...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.61,0:49:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,一旦你进去, 一直游到底…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once you get in, swim to the bottom of the chamber...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.08,0:49:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,剩下的听我的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll talk you through the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.88,0:49:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好 - 去吧, 你没问题的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- OK. - It'll be a piece of kelp.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.12,0:49:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,干得漂亮!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nicely done!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.52,0:49:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你听到我的话了吗? - 是的!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you hear me? - Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.29,0:49:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,鹅卵石来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here comes the pebble.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.07,0:49:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.73,0:49:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,现在, 你看到了一个小孔了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, do you see a small opening?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.57,0:49:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,啊哈!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.04,0:49:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,进去, 你会看到一个转动的风扇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inside it, you'll see a rotating fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.24,0:49:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,把这个鹅卵石塞进风扇 使它停转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wedge that pebble into the fan to stop it turning.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.18,0:49:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.52,0:50:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- 小心, 鲨鱼饵! - 我不行!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Careful, Sharkbait! - I can't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.85,0:50:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,吉哥, 这个主意不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gill, this isn't a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.42,0:50:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,他行的 再试试!\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll be fine. Try again!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.22,0:50:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.96,0:50:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这样, 鲨鱼饵\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it, Sharkbait.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.46,0:50:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,又准又稳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice and steady.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.23,0:50:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我成功了! 我成功了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it! I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.83,0:50:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他成功了! - 太好了, 孩子!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He did it! - That's great, kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.60,0:50:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,现在顺着水管游上, 就出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now swim up the tube and out.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.09,0:50:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,啊, 不! 吉哥!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no! Gill!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.86,0:50:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 鲨鱼饵! - 啊, 糟了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sharkbait! - Oh, my gosh!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.09,0:50:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,把他弄出来!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him outta there!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.36,0:50:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们该怎么办? - 啊, 不!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do we do? - Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.93,0:50:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,冷静, 孩子 千万别慌张!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay calm, kid. Just don't panic!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.93,0:50:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,救我!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.37,0:50:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,鲨鱼饵, 咬住这个!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharkbait, grab hold of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.24,0:50:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不! 不! 不! - 再多伸进去一些!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! No! No! - Feed me more!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.24,0:51:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 就只能伸进去这么长了! - 鲨鱼饵! 咬住!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's it! - Sharkbait! Grab it!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.21,0:51:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我咬住它了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.95,0:51:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,用力拉!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.42,0:51:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,吉哥, 别让他再去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gill, don't make him go back in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.36,0:51:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 我不会再让他去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. We're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.44,0:51:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.18,0:51:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uhh - Uhh. - Dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.28,0:51:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,集中精神, 伙计 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Focus, dude. Dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.82,0:51:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohh.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.49,0:51:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,啊, 他活过来了 嘿, 伙计!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, he lives. Hey, dude!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.12,0:51:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,出了什么事?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohh. What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.53,0:51:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我看见整件事的经过, 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saw the whole thing, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.63,0:51:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,首先, 你像这样,"哇!"…\N{\fnArial\fs30}First, you were all, like, "Whoa!"...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.53,0:51:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,接着你像这样,"哇!"…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then we were all, like, "Whoa!"...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.20,0:51:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,最后你像这样,"哇…"\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then you were, like, "Whoa".
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.13,0:51:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你在说什么呀?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.60,0:52:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你, 小丑鱼 大战水母群\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, mini-man. Takin' on the jellies.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.07,0:52:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你可真会找刺激啊, 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got serious thrill issues, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.94,0:52:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哦 - 佩服\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ohh. - Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.24,0:52:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,啊, 我好难受, 我想吐!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uhh. Oh, my stomach. Ohh!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.48,0:52:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,啊, 伙计 别吐在我背上, 好吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man. No hurlin' on the shell, dude, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.48,0:52:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚打过腊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just waxed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.72,0:52:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,海龟先生...\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Mr. Turtle...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.99,0:52:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,哇, 伙计 海龟先生是我老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, dude. Mr. Turtle is my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.39,0:52:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫龟龟\N{\fnArial\fs30}The name's Crush.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.86,0:52:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,龟龟? 真的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crush? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.22,0:52:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,好的, 龟龟 我想去东澳洲暖流\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, Crush. I need to the East Australian Current.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.93,0:52:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,就是EAC\N{\fnArial\fs30}E. A. C. ?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.20,0:52:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,啊, 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.17,0:52:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,远在天边, 近在眼前, 伙计!\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're ridin' it, dude!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.57,0:52:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,抬头瞧瞧吧!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.18,0:52:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,好, 系上安全带, 朋友!\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, grab shell, dude!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.09,0:52:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,系上什…什么? !\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab wh-a-a-at? !
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.85,0:52:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,系上什…什么? !\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab wh-a-a-at? !
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.23,0:53:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了! 太棒了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha ha! Righteous! Righteous!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.93,0:53:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是的! - 停了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah! - Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.67,0:53:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,那么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.17,0:53:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你们大老远的跑东奥暖流来干什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What brings you on this fine day to the E. A. C. ?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.74,0:53:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,多莉和我要去悉尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory and I need to get to Sydney.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.38,0:53:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,多莉! 她没出什么事情吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory! Is she all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.65,0:53:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,啊, 你是说那个蓝色的小家伙吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh? Oh, little blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.55,0:53:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,她在下面, 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is sub-level, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.29,0:53:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,多莉! 多莉! 多莉!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory! Dory! Dory!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.89,0:53:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,多莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.36,0:53:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.23,0:53:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,那都是我的错 是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is all my fault. It's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.60,0:53:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,29, 30! 准备好了, 我来了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty-nine, thirty! Ready or not, here I come!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.57,0:53:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你在哪儿啊? !\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.88,0:53:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,有本事就来抓我!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Catch me if you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.78,0:54:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,多莉?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.18,0:54:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,漂亮的水波!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice wave!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.05,0:54:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.07,0:54:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heh heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.82,0:54:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,送你上去!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.26,0:54:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,送你上去!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.64,0:54:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,喔呜! 喔呜!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo-hoo! Whoo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.73,0:54:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,哇! 哇!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.46,0:54:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,哇-啊-啊-啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa-oh-oh-oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.70,0:54:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 啊, 我的老天! - 没关系, 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my goodness! - Kill the motor, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.34,0:54:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们来看看小古的个人单飞表演\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us see what Squirt does flying solo.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.41,0:54:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,哇!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.15,0:54:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,哇! 这真酷!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! That was so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.18,0:54:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿, 老爸, 你看到了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Dad, did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.02,0:54:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你看到我了吗? 你看我我刚才做的事了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see me? Did you see what I did?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.39,0:54:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你真棒, 儿子!\N{\fnArial\fs30}You so totally rock, Squirt!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.39,0:54:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,来我们来击掌\N{\fnArial\fs30}So give me some fin.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.96,0:54:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,碰头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noggin.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.39,0:54:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 朋友 - 朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dude. - Dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.80,0:54:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…介绍一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh... intro.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.23,0:54:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,水母游侠, 这是我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jellyman, offspring.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.17,0:54:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我儿子小古, 水母游侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Offspring, Jellyman.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.27,0:54:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 水母游侠? ! 厉害 - 那当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jellies? ! Sweet. - Totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.84,0:55:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,那不算什么, 承蒙各位夸奖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, I must've done something you liked... dudes.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.11,0:55:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你很棒, 朋友! - 哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You rock, dude! - Ow.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.58,0:55:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,去冲浪玩吧, 孩子 养孩子可真是烦人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Curl away, my son. It's awesome, Jellyman.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.35,0:55:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这些小家伙刚才还是蛋蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}The little dudes are just eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.05,0:55:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我们把他们留在沙滩孵化…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We leave 'em on a beach to hatch...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.85,0:55:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,之后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then, coo-coo-cachoo...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.15,0:55:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他们就自己找回了来大海的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}they find their way back to the big ol' blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.59,0:55:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 全凭他们自己? - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All by themselves? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.96,0:55:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,但伙计, 你如何知道他们自己就能行呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, dude, how do you know when they're ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.99,0:55:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯, 其实你并不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you never really know.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.26,0:55:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,但当他们回来, 你就知道了, 你懂吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when they know, you'll know, you know? Ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.90,0:55:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿, 大家来看啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.37,0:55:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我认识那个朋友! 他叫水母游侠!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that dude! It's the Jellyman!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.11,0:55:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你们去吧 抱抱他吧!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on. Jump on him!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.18,0:55:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 乌龟炸弹! - 等等!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Turtle pile! - Wait, wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.41,0:55:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你觉得好玩吗? - 你的壳在哪里?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you funny? - Where's your shell?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.52,0:55:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我要透口气! - 你想逃跑吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I need to breathe! - Are you running away?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.62,0:55:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的穿过了水母群?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you really cross the jellyfish forest?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.32,0:55:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 它们没有刺你吗? - 刺过一次!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did they sting you? - One at a time!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.32,0:55:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,鱼先生, 那你死了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Fish, did you die?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.02,0:55:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉, 我也想听听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, I was a little vague on the detaiIs.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.59,0:55:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,那, 你要去哪里?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.79,0:55:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样的, 我儿子被抓了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, my son was taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.69,0:55:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我儿子被人类抓走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My son was taken away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.56,0:55:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 胡扯 - 发生了什么事?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No way. - What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.87,0:56:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,不, 孩子们 我不想谈这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, kids. I don't want to talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.07,0:56:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,求你, 说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aww! Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.44,0:56:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.81,0:56:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯, 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.54,0:56:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我住在大堡礁 离这里很远很远\N{\fnArial\fs30}I live on this reef a long, long way from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.41,0:56:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这故事会很有趣 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is gonna be good. I can tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.48,0:56:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,而我的儿子尼莫…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my son Nemo...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.92,0:56:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧, 他故意和我闹别扭\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, he was mad at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.92,0:56:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我不对他那么粗暴…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And maybe he wouldn't have done it...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.59,0:56:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,他不会那么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I hadn't been so tough on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.12,0:56:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,谁知道呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.39,0:56:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,总之, 他朝深处的游艇游过去了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, he swam out in the open water to this boat...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.43,0:56:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,当他到那里时, 潜水员出现了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and when he was out there, these divers appeared...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.33,0:56:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我想阻止他们, 但那游艇速度太快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I tried to stop them, but the boat was too fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.00,0:56:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,所以, 我只好深入大海 , 一直跟踪…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we swam out in the ocean to follow them...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.80,0:56:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,尼莫的爸爸来不及追上它…\N{\fnArial\fs30}They couldn't stop 'em. And then Nemo's dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.17,0:56:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,他就游进了大海, 碰到了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}he swims out to the ocean, and they bump into...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.97,0:56:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,…三条凶残的鲨鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}three ferocious sharks.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.31,0:56:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,他用水雷把鲨鱼吓跑了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}He scares away the sharks by blowing 'em up!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.44,0:56:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐, 他可真了不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Golly, that's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.81,0:56:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,然后他下潜了几千英尺…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then dives thousands of feet...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.48,0:56:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,…那里漆黑一片\N{\fnArial\fs30}straight down into the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.25,0:56:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,伸手不见五指\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's wicked dark down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.75,0:56:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,伸手不见五指 怎么办?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't see a thing. How's it going, Bob?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.48,0:56:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,在那里他唯一能看到的是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the only thing they can see down there...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.18,0:56:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,…来自这个巨大恐怖生物的光…\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the light from this big, horrible creature...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.95,0:56:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,带着利刃般锋利的牙齿 躲得好, 老家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}with razor-sharp teeth. Nice parry, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.96,0:56:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,他得尽快找到…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then he has to blast his way...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.36,0:56:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,所以, 这两条小鱼已经…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, these two little fish have been...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.02,0:57:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,在东奥洋流中搜寻了几天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}searching the ocean for days on the East Australian Current.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.56,0:57:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说它也许现在就在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means that he may be on his way here right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.93,0:57:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这可以带他到悉尼…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That should put him in Sydney Harbor...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.50,0:57:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,…一天之内 我是说, 听起来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a matter of days. I mean, it sounds like...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.83,0:57:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这家伙找不到他的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}this guy is gonna stop at nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.87,0:57:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,是誓不罢休… 我真心地希望他能成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}till he finds his son. I sure hope he makes it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.67,0:57:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以说这是个有责任心的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's one dedicated father, if you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.28,0:57:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我的! 我的! 我的! 我的! 我的!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine! Mine! Mine! Mine! Mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.25,0:57:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我的! 我的! 我的! 我的! 我的! 我的!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine! Mine! Mine! Mine! Mine! Mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.59,0:57:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我的! 我的! 我的! 我的! 我的! 我的!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine! Mine! Mine! Mine! Mine! Mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.32,0:57:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你们能住嘴吗? !\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you just shut up? !
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.76,0:57:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你们简直是一群会飞的老鼠!\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're rats with wings!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.26,0:57:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,那条鱼一直在找他的儿子尼莫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bloke's been looking for his boy Nemo.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.80,0:57:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 尼莫? ! - 他被人类带离了大堡礁…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nemo? ! - He was taken off the reef...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.17,0:57:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 拿去! 高兴了吧? - 我的! 我的! 我的!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Take it! You happy? - Mine! Mine! Mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.23,0:57:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿, 再说一遍! 关于尼莫的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, say that again! Something about Nemo.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.07,0:57:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我的! 我的! 我的!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine! Mine! Mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.22,0:57:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,哇哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoooa.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.75,0:57:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,哈!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hyah!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.01,0:57:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.61,0:57:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,最新的消息是, 他正在来这的路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last I heard, he's heading towards the harbor.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.88,0:57:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,啊! 太好了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ho ho! BriIliant!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.19,0:58:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,他没事吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he doing OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.70,0:58:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,他没事吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he doing OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.26,0:58:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,无论你做什么, 不要提那个女孩的名字...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you do, Don't mention D-a-r...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.50,0:58:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系 我知道你们在说谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's OK. I know who you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.38,0:58:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,吉哥?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gill?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.18,0:58:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,吉哥?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gill?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.95,0:58:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿, 鲨鱼饵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Sharkbait.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.65,0:58:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起, 我不能弄停那个...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry I couldn't stop the...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.92,0:58:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不, 应该是我道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm the one who should be sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.12,0:58:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我太想出去了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was so ready to get out...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.79,0:58:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,太想尝尝大海的味道…\N{\fnArial\fs30}so ready to taste that ocean...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.60,0:58:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,为此我甚至要你去冒生命危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was willing to put you in harm's way to get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.07,0:58:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对不值得这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing should be worth that.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.07,0:58:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起, 我不能帮你会到你父亲身边, 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry I couldn't get you back to your father, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.01,0:58:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 嘿, 嘿, 嘿...\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Hey, hey, hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.95,0:58:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the... - Aaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.61,0:59:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,那是拔牙的唯一方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's one way to pull a tooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.38,0:59:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,该死的小家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh. Darn kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.52,0:59:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,好消息是我拔对了牙, 不是吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good thing I pulled the right one, eh, Prime Minister?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.56,0:59:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, psst!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.16,0:59:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,啊, 祖哥! 你刚好错过了一次拔牙表演\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Nigel! You just missed an extraction.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.19,0:59:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,他弄松了牙组织韧带了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has he loosened the periodontal ligament yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.86,0:59:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我在胡说些什么呀? 尼莫在哪里?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I talking about? Where's Nemo?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.03,0:59:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我有话要跟他说 - 是什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I've got to speak with him. - What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.33,0:59:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你的爸爸正在穿越整个大海…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dad's been fighting the entire ocean...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.47,0:59:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 就为了找到你 - 我父亲? 真的吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Iooking for you. - My father? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.14,0:59:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,他辗转数百海里, 打败鲨鱼穿越水母群...\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's traveled hundreds of miles, battling sharks and jellyfish...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.31,0:59:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,鲨鱼? 那不可能是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharks? That can't be him.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.85,0:59:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,它是什么鱼来着? 一种观赏鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was his name? Some sort of sport fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.48,0:59:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 金枪鱼? 鳟鱼? - 莫林?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tuna? Trout? - Marlin?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.68,0:59:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,对, 他的名字叫莫林! 来自大堡礁的小丑鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marlin! The little clownfish from the reef.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.55,0:59:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,是我老爸! 他打败鲨鱼了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my dad! He took on a shark!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.19,0:59:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我听说是三条\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard he took on three.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.56,0:59:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 三条鲨鱼? - 那可是四千八百颗牙齿!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Three sharks? - That's 4, 800 teeth!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.43,0:59:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,自从你被那条船抓走后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}After you were taken by Diver Dan over there...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.56,0:59:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你父亲像疯了一样跟着那艘船\N{\fnArial\fs30}your dad followed the boat like a maniac.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.83,0:59:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,真的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.23,0:59:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,他追啊追, 不顾一切得追\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's swimming, giving it all he's got...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.07,0:59:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,突然三条鲨鱼碰到了他…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then three gigantic sharks capture him...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.17,0:59:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他炸飞了他们 然后潜到了几千英尺下面…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he blows them up and dives thousands of feet...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.47,1:00:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,又被长着巨大牙齿的怪兽追捕!\N{\fnArial\fs30}and gets chased by a monster with huge teeth!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.34,1:00:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,他把那个怪兽绑在了岩石上, 他得到了什么奖赏呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}He ties this demon to a rock, and what's his reward?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.01,1:00:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,他和整个水母群战斗!\N{\fnArial\fs30}He gets to battle an entire jellyfish forest!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.41,1:00:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,现在他正和一群海龟在东流上…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now he's with a bunch of sea turtles on the E. A. C...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.65,1:00:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,顺着东奥暖流直奔悉尼!\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the word is he's headed this way right now... to Sydney!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.19,1:00:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哇 - 多么了不起的爸爸!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wow! - What a good daddy!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.59,1:00:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,他终于来找你了, 鲨鱼饵\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was looking for you after all, Sharkbait.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.66,1:00:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,他向过滤器游去了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's swimming to the filter!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.33,1:00:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 鲨鱼饵! - 别再这样了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sharkbait! - Not again!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.37,1:00:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,鲨鱼饵!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharkbait!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.34,1:00:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不!\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.74,1:00:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你在拿你的生命冒险!\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got your whole life ahead of you!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.97,1:00:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们会帮你的, 孩子! - 把他弄出来!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We'll help you, kid! - Get him out!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.68,1:00:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,把他弄出来!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him out of there!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.38,1:00:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,快点, 孩子! 抓住末端!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, kid! Grab the end!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.05,1:00:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,鲨鱼饵!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharkbait!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.68,1:00:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不! - 听到我的话了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.75,1:00:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,尼莫! 你听得到吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nemo! Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.29,1:00:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,是的, 我听得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I can hear you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.36,1:00:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,鲨鱼饵, 你成功了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharkbait, you did it!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.32,1:00:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,鲨鱼饵, 你… 身上全都是细菌! 啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharkbait, you're... covered with germs! Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.16,1:00:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,真勇敢, 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha ha! That took guts, kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.23,1:01:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,好了, 弟兄们, 达拉回来之前, 我们只有不到48小时的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, gang, we have less than 48 hours... before Darla gets here.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.10,1:01:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,到那时候这个水箱会脏乱不堪…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This tank'll get plenty dirty in that time...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.84,1:01:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要尽量努力搞脏它\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we have to help it along any way we can.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.71,1:01:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 虾虾? 停止清理 - 我尽力而为\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jacques? No cleaning. - I shall resist.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.01,1:01:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,其他人尽可能搞脏这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody else, be as gross as possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.71,1:01:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,用肮脏的方法思维\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think dirty thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.98,1:01:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要搞的这个水箱 脏到…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna make this tank so filthy...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.21,1:01:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,那个牙医不得不清理的地步\N{\fnArial\fs30}the dentist will have to clean it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.78,1:01:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 干得好! - 哈哈哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good work! - Ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.43,1:01:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,好了, 我们到了, 伙计们!\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we're here, dudes!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.99,1:01:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,准备! 你出口就要到了, 伙计!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get ready! Your exit's coming up, man!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.23,1:01:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,哪里? 我看不到!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where? I don't see it!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.77,1:01:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,就在那边! 我看到了! 我看到了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right there! I see it! I see it!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.24,1:01:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说那个恐怖的漩涡?\N{\fnArial\fs30}The swirling vortex of terror?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.41,1:01:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是的, 伙计 - 就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's it, dude. - Of course it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.74,1:01:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,好了, 首先, 找一个冲出去的伙伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, first, find your exit buddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.81,1:01:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,找到冲出去的伙伴了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have your exit buddy?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.35,1:01:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,是的!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.62,1:01:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,小虎还会给你演示正确的起跳姿势\N{\fnArial\fs30}Squirt give you a rundown of proper exiting technique.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.39,1:01:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,下午好! 今天我们要进行最刺激的跳跃!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good afternoon! We'll have a great jump today!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.96,1:01:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,好, 碰到水壁时 要使劲的往回冲\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, crank a hard cutback as you hit the wall.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.69,1:02:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,漩涡下面有厉害的回旋!\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a screaming bottom turn, so watch out!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.66,1:02:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,记住-快接, 快滑!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember... rip it, roll it, and punch it!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.97,1:02:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我看出来了, 它好像是跟我说话呐!\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's trying to speak to me, I know it!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.14,1:02:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 你讲得很棒, 但我一句也没听懂!\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're really cute, but I don't know what you're saying!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.41,1:02:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你再重复一遍, 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say the first thing again.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.71,1:02:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,好的, 水母游侠! 出发!\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, Jellyman! Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.48,1:02:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哇! - 哇哦!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whoa! - Wahoo!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.05,1:02:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哇! - 哇!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whoa! - Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.10,1:02:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.59,1:02:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这很…有趣!\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was... fun!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.23,1:02:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我真得觉得很过瘾啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I actually enjoyed that.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.53,1:02:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿, 瞧, 乌龟们!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look, turtles!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.20,1:02:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,很完美!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha ha! Most excellent!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.17,1:02:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,启动你的鱼尾吧…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now turn your fishy taiIs around...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.97,1:02:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,直接游向悉尼吧!\N{\fnArial\fs30}and swim straight on through to Sydney!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.21,1:02:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,旅途愉快, 伙计!\N{\fnArial\fs30}No worries, man!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.41,1:02:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,一路顺风! 谢谢, 龟龟朋友!\N{\fnArial\fs30}No worries! Thank you, dude Crush!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.51,1:02:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 再见! - 再见, 水母游侠!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bye! - Bye, Jellyman!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.11,1:02:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,转告你的小家伙, 我的问候, 好吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell your little dude I said hi, OK?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.45,1:02:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,回头见, 伙计们!\N{\fnArial\fs30}See ya later, dudes!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.65,1:02:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,再见, 大家!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.42,1:02:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,尼莫应该会喜欢这个的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nemo would have loved this.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.79,1:03:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,啊! 嘿! 龟龟, 我忘了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh! Hey! Crush, I forgot!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.16,1:03:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你多大了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How old are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.76,1:03:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,150岁, 朋友! 还很年轻!\N{\fnArial\fs30}150, dude! And still young! Rock on!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.00,1:03:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,150岁! 150岁! 我可不会忘的\N{\fnArial\fs30}150! 150! I gotta remember that.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.07,1:03:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.07,1:03:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是往那边走吗? - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We going in there? - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.74,1:03:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,悉尼, 袋鼠路 42号 歇尔曼?\N{\fnArial\fs30}P. Sherman, 42 Wallaby Way, Sydney?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.84,1:03:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 我们只要直着游就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep. We're gonna just swim straight.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.52,1:03:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,只要继续游 只要继续游\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just keep swimming, just keep swimming...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.32,1:03:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,多莉…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.26,1:03:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐, 这还要花一段时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy, this is taking awhile.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.93,1:03:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们玩个猜谜游戏如何?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about we play a game?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.67,1:03:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.97,1:03:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,好, 我在想一种橙色的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, I'm thinking of something orange...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.07,1:03:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,个子小的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's small...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.61,1:03:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 就是我 - 对!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's me. - Right!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.94,1:03:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,橙色的, 小的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's orange and small...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.55,1:03:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,就是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.88,1:04:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,没错, 机灵鬼先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}All righty, Mr. Smartypants.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.82,1:04:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,橙色的, 而且, 有白条纹的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's orange and small and white stripes...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.68,1:04:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,橙色的, 而且, 有白条纹的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's orange and small and white stripes...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.02,1:04:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我 我猜下一个谜语的答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me. And the next one, just a guess, me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.29,1:04:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- 还是我 你吓坏我了 - 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's just scary. - Wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.86,1:04:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我之前肯定是见过这个漂浮物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have definitely seen this floating speck before.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.73,1:04:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说, 我们之前来过这里…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means we've passed it before...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.29,1:04:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说, 我们在兜圈…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that means we're going in circles...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.70,1:04:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说, 我们没有走直线!\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that means we're not going straight!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.36,1:04:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿, 嘿! - 到水面去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, hey! - Get to the surface.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.50,1:04:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,上到那里我们会搞清楚的 走吧!\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll figure it out up there. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.13,1:04:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿! 放松点 - 什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey! Relax. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.37,1:04:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,深呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a deep breath.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.91,1:04:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,现在, 我们去找个人问一下路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, let's ask somebody for directions.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.41,1:04:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,现在, 我们去找个人问一下路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, let's ask somebody for directions.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.24,1:04:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 你想问谁, 那个漂浮物吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. Who do you want to ask, the speck?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.31,1:04:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这儿没有其他鱼! - 一定有其他的鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's nobody here! - There has to be someone.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.71,1:04:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这是大海, 笨蛋 不会只有我们两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the ocean, siIly. We're not the only two in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.62,1:04:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,让我瞧瞧 是的, 这边没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see. OK, no one there.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.99,1:04:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,空空如也\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope. Nada.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.86,1:04:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,那里有鱼 嘿! 打扰...\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's somebody. Hey! Excuse...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.69,1:04:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,多莉, 多莉, 多莉! 该我出题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory, Dory, Dory! Now it's my turn.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.56,1:04:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我想这是某种可怕神秘的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thinking of something dark and mysterious.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.20,1:04:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,是一种我们不了解的鱼 如果我们向它问路…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a fish we don't know. If we ask it directions...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.60,1:04:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,他可能会把我们吞下去 再吐出我们的骨头!\N{\fnArial\fs30}it could ingest us and spit out our bones!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.67,1:04:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,一个大男人问个路怎么也这么麻烦?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it with men and asking for directions?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.17,1:04:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在不想说男人和女人的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to play the gender card right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.01,1:05:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只想说保命的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's play the "Let's Not Die" card.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.98,1:05:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你想离开这里吗? - 当然想\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You want to get out of here? - Of course I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.91,1:05:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,除非我们问他 不然我们怎么离开这里呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are we gonna do that unless we give it a shot?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.21,1:05:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,多莉, 你没有完全明白...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory, you don't fully understand...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.25,1:05:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样 相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Trust me on this.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.33,1:05:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.16,1:05:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,打扰了! 小家伙?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me! Whoo-hoo! Little fella?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.47,1:05:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你好! 别没礼貌 打招呼呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello! Don't be rude. Say hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.30,1:05:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你好! 别没礼貌 打招呼呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello! Don't be rude. Say hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.44,1:05:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha. Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.51,1:05:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他的儿子槟格 - 是尼莫\N{\fnArial\fs30}- His son Bingo... - Nemo.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.07,1:05:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 尼莫被抓到 - 悉尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nemo was taken to... - Sydney.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.14,1:05:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,悉尼! 尽快赶到那里 对我们来说真得很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sydney! And it's really, really important... that we get there as fast as we can...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.35,1:05:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你能帮我们吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}so can you help us out?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.48,1:05:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样, 小家伙 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, little fella. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.05,1:05:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,多莉, 我才是小家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory, I'm a little fella.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.32,1:05:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我不认为那是个小家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think that's a little fella.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.83,1:05:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,啊! 大家伙 鲸 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Big fella. Whale. OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.77,1:06:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,也许他只会说鲸语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he only speaks whale.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.27,1:06:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我我们 想想要…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mooo! Weee neeed...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.54,1:06:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 多莉? - 找找到到他的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dory? - Tooo fiind his son.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.68,1:06:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干什么? 你肯定你说的是鲸语?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing? Are you sure you speak whale?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.38,1:06:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你你能告诉我们方方向吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can youuuu give us diiirectionsss?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.65,1:06:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你…你能告诉我们方…方向吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can youuuu give us diiirectionsss?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.81,1:06:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,多莉! 只有鬼知道你在说什么!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory! Heaven knows what you're saying!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.18,1:06:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 瞧, 他游走了 - 回…回…来…来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- See, he's swimming away. - Cooome baaack.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.82,1:06:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,他不会回来了 他一定生气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not coming back. You offended him.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.12,1:06:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,也许该用另一种鲸语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe a different dialect.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.36,1:06:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 喔喔喔 - 多莉!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Moooohhhmmooo... - Dory!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.59,1:06:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这根本不是鲸语 你说得是胡话\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not whale. You're speaking upset stomach.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.90,1:06:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 也许我应该试试座头鲸语 - 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe I should try humpback. - Don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.20,1:06:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 也许我应该试试座头鲸语 - 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe I should try humpback. - Don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.08,1:06:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,呜呜呜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wooooooo...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.63,1:06:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 难听死了 - 也许该更大声点吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You actually sound sick. - Maybe louder?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.64,1:06:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 啊 啊 - 别这样!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rah! Rah! - Don't do that!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.14,1:06:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,太像虎鲸了 听起来像虎鲸吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too much orca. Didn't it sound orca-ish?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.91,1:06:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,行了, 不像虎鲸\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't sound orca.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.28,1:06:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你说得什么鱼都不像\N{\fnArial\fs30}It sounds like nothing I've ever heard.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.06,1:06:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 呜呜 - 哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oooooo! - Ohh!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.65,1:06:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,也许此时 他正饿着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just as well. He might be hungry.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.21,1:06:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,也许此时 他正饿着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just as well. He might be hungry.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.61,1:06:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,鲸不吃小丑鱼 他们吃海虾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whales don't eat clownfish. They eat krill.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.65,1:06:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快游开! - 啊, 瞧, 海虾!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Swim away! - Oh, look, krill!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.59,1:06:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑, 多莉, 快跑!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move, Dory, move!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.56,1:06:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑, 多莉, 快跑!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move, Dory, move!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.11,1:07:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 啊 - 啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Aah! - Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.17,1:07:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧 你看到了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at that. Would you look at that?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.97,1:07:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,肮脏 绝对肮脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}FiIthy. Absolutely fiIthy.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.97,1:07:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你, 孩子 这都是你的功劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}All thanks to you, kid. You made it possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.01,1:07:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,虾虾, 我说过不用清理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jacques, I said no cleaning.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.14,1:07:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我受不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am ashamed.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.95,1:07:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧! 垃圾天使!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look! Scum angel!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.60,1:07:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh! Aaah!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.62,1:07:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,泡泡! 我爱泡泡!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bubbles! I love the bubbles!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.62,1:07:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,亮亮? 有人见过亮亮吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flo? Has anybody seen Flo?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.29,1:07:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,9:00 牙医来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}9:00 and cue dentist.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.96,1:07:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你好, 芭芭拉 对不起我迟到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Barbara. Sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.27,1:07:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,好, 我们做好准备 我们做好准备, 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, here we go. Here we go, OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.00,1:07:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,小大卫 雷诺斯, 你好吗…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little Davey Reynolds...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.77,1:07:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,走向工作台了, 放下钥匙…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walks to the counter, drops the keys...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.40,1:07:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,张开, 真令人恶心!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bloat, that's disgusting!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.54,1:07:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,对我来说味道不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tastes pretty good to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.56,1:07:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 呃 - 哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Urrrp! - Eww!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.41,1:07:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,人类哪知道这是我们鱼类的杰作!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you people realize we are swimming in our own...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.31,1:07:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,嘘! 他来了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh! Here he comes!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.39,1:07:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.45,1:07:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,奇怪 真是脏透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crikey. What a state.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.22,1:08:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 芭芭拉, 我明天最早的预约是几点?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohh. Barbara, what's my earliest appointment tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.39,1:08:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 10:00整 - 10点之前不接病人, 听到了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 10:00, luv. - Leave it open, would you?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.36,1:08:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,在达拉到这里之前 我得清理下鱼缸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've gotta clean the fish tank before Darla gets here.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.73,1:08:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你听到了吗, 鲨鱼饵?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hear that, Sharkbait?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.87,1:08:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,是的! 他要清理鱼缸!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yay! He's gonna clean the tank!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.60,1:08:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以出去了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna be clean!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.41,1:08:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你准备好去见你老爸了吗, 孩子?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready to see your dad, kid?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.11,1:08:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 啊哈 - 你当然准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uh-huh. - Of course you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.08,1:08:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我想他一定在海港那边的码头上等着迎接你呐 你说对吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't be surprised if he's out there... in the harbor waiting for you right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.02,1:08:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.38,1:09:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aaah!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.55,1:09:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,噢!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oof!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.56,1:09:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,喔!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.10,1:09:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,是呀!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yaahhh!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.39,1:09:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,来了一个大浪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here comes the big one.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.15,1:09:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,啊! 快点! 你别错过机会!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh! Come on! You gotta try this!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.72,1:09:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你能不能别闹了? - 为什么? 有什么问题吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Will you just stop it? - Why? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.03,1:09:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在鲸鱼的肚子里面, 你还不明白吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in a whale, don't you get it?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.36,1:09:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 鲸鱼? - 一头鲸鱼!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whale? - A whale!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.56,1:09:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这都怪你问什么路! 这就是问路的下场!\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had to ask for help! And now we're stuck here!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.33,1:10:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,鲸鱼 你知道的, 我懂鲸语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, a whale. I speak whale.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.14,1:10:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不, 你疯了! 你根本不会说鲸语!\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're insane! You can't speak whale!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.50,1:10:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我得出去! 我得去找我儿子!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to get out! I have to find my son!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.74,1:10:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我的告诉他海龟有多老!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to tell him how old sea turtles are!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.46,1:10:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,哦!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohhh!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.70,1:10:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,呜呼呜呼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo-hoo-hoo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.16,1:10:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.03,1:10:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}you OK?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.37,1:10:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样 一切都会好起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There, there. It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.41,1:10:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.37,1:10:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不, 不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, it won't.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.64,1:10:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定会没事的 等着瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure it will. You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.91,1:10:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我向他保证过 不会让他有任何事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I promised him I'd never let anything happen to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.08,1:10:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,真是奇怪的许诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh. That's a funny thing to promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.52,1:10:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.92,1:10:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你不可能不让他出任何事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't never let anything happen to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.39,1:11:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,那等于不让他做任何事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then nothing would ever happen to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.86,1:11:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,那他什么乐趣也没有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not much fun for little Harpo.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.48,1:11:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - 发生什么事了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hmm. - What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.34,1:11:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道 我要问问他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't know. I'll ask him.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.18,1:11:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 多莉… - 发…发生什么事了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dory... - Whaaat's goooing onnn?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.26,1:11:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我想他嫌我们太吵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he says we've stopped.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.90,1:11:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是够吵的了 不要再说什么鲸语了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course we've stopped. Stop trying to speak whale.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.20,1:11:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你会令一切变得更糟 那是什么声音音?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll make things worse. What is that noise?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.11,1:11:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,啊, 不 瞧你都干了些什么呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. Look what you did.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.94,1:11:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,水位在下降 在下降!\N{\fnArial\fs30}The water's going down. It's going down!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.62,1:11:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,真的? 你肯定吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? You sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.09,1:12:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧! 水只剩下一半了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look! Already it's half empty!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.19,1:12:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,应该说还有一半\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say it's half full.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.99,1:12:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,够了! 还剩一半\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop that! It's half empty!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.53,1:12:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,好, 这句可不大好翻译\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, that one was a little tougher.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.76,1:12:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,他或许在说我们应该进他的喉咙去…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He either said we should go to the back of the throat...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.70,1:12:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,或者他想喝点无酒精饮料\N{\fnArial\fs30}or he wants a root beer float.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.90,1:12:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这话不是明摆着的嘛!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course he wants us to go there!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.57,1:12:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,他是要吃掉我们了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's eating us!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.54,1:12:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我的味道如何, 大家伙Moby(小说《白鲸记》中的角色)? 我的味道很好吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do I taste, Moby? Do I taste good?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.49,1:12:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉他我对成为他的午餐没兴趣!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him I'm not interested in being lunch!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.84,1:12:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好的 他…他 - 别对他说了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- OK. Heee... - Stop talking to him!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.56,1:12:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 啊 - 啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Aah! - Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.49,1:12:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.69,1:12:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我看看 什么…么事...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll check. Whaaat...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.02,1:12:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不要再说鲸语了! 你不会说鲸语了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more whale! You can't speak whale!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.83,1:12:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我会! - 你不会!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, I can! - No, you can't!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.20,1:12:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为你会, 但其实你不会, 尼莫!\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you can do these things, but you can't, Nemo!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.77,1:12:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好了 - 多莉, 别!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- OK. - Dory! Oof!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.18,1:12:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,他说是让我们离开的时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says it's time to let go.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.81,1:13:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's gonna be all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.82,1:13:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.52,1:13:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道我们不会碰上倒霉的事情?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know something bad isn't gonna happen?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.65,1:13:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.71,1:13:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 啊 - 啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Aah! - Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.02,1:13:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 啊 - 啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Aah! - Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.95,1:13:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 啊 - 啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Aah! - Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.18,1:13:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还活着!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha ha ha! We're alive!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.01,1:13:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧! 悉-尼-悉尼!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look! Sy-d-ney... Sydney!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.92,1:13:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,悉尼! 又是悉尼!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sydney! Sydney again!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.36,1:13:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你是对的, 多莉! 我们成功了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right, Dory! We made it!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.86,1:13:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会找到我儿子的!\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna find my son!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.36,1:13:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,谢-谢 你-你, 先-生!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thaaank yoouuu, sirrr!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.80,1:13:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,谢-谢 你-你, 先-生!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thaaank yoouuu, sirrr!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.90,1:13:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我真希望我会说鲸语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. I wish I could speak whale.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.40,1:13:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要做的是找到抓走他的那艘船\N{\fnArial\fs30}All we gotta do is find the boat that took him.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.74,1:14:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 对! - 我们行的!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right! - We can do this!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.46,1:14:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,早\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.79,1:14:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,是早晨了, 大家! 今天就是那个逃亡日!\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's morning, everyone! Today's the day!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.09,1:14:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,阳光明媚 鱼缸干净了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sun is shining, the tank is clean...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.30,1:14:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就要出去了-鱼缸干净了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we are getting out... The tank is clean.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.40,1:14:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,鱼缸干净了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tank is clean!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.00,1:14:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么会?\N{\fnArial\fs30}But how?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.64,1:14:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,当我们熟睡的时候 一定是牙医装了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boss must've installed it while we were sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.37,1:14:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们该怎么做? - 有什么办法, 桃桃?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are we gonna do? - What's it say, Peach?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.21,1:14:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我听不到, 桃桃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't hear you, Peach.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.58,1:14:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,2003水得清 具有自动清洁\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Aquascum 2003 is an all-purpose, self-cleaning...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.05,1:14:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,免于维护污水过滤等功能…\N{\fnArial\fs30}maintenance-free, salt water purifier...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.05,1:14:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,保证大大延长你水族箱里的鱼的寿命\N{\fnArial\fs30}that is guaranteed to extend the life of your aquarium fish.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.09,1:14:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,别说了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.35,1:14:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,2003水得清设定为…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Aquascum is programmed to scan...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.89,1:14:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,每五分钟扫瞄一次你的鱼缸\N{\fnArial\fs30}your tank environment every five minutes? !
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.23,1:14:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,扫瞄? 那是什么意思?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scan? What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.51,1:14:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.80,1:14:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,温度-华氏82度…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Temperature... 82 degrees...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.20,1:15:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,温度-华氏82度…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Temperature... 82 degrees...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.40,1:15:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,酸硷值-正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}PH balance... normal.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.10,1:15:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 啊 - 不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ooh. - Nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.54,1:15:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,啊-啊! 去死吧, 水得清!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh... Oh! Curse you, Aquascum!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.14,1:15:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的逃跑计划又完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it for the escape plan. It's ruined.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.28,1:15:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们下步做什么...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what are we gonna do about...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.75,1:15:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,达拉!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darla!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.21,1:15:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,达拉!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darla!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.78,1:15:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,躲起来, 孩子!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay down, kid!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.42,1:15:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 虚惊一场 - 呼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- False alarm. - Whew.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.42,1:15:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我的神经再也经受不了了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My nerves can't take much more of this.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.55,1:15:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我们该怎么对付那个金鱼杀手?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'll we do when that brat gets here?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.82,1:15:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我正在考虑 - 啊! 吉哥!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm thinking. - Oh! Gill!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.09,1:15:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 尼莫! 我来了! - 救我! 救我!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nemo! I'm coming! - Help me! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.30,1:15:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,往下游! 快点, 孩子!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Swim down! Come on, kid!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.23,1:15:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 大家跳进来! - 向下游!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Everybody jump in! - Swim down!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.77,1:15:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 就是这样! - 怎么回事?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's it! - What the...?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.10,1:15:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 耶！ - 干得好!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yay! - Ha ha! Good work!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.41,1:15:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,吉哥!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gill!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.97,1:15:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 尼莫! - 鲨鱼饵!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nemo! - Sharkbait!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.61,1:15:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快打滚, 孩子! - 翻过来! 翻过来!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Roll, kid! - Lean! Lean!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.48,1:15:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,差点就掉下去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoops. That would've been a nasty fall.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.95,1:15:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,吉哥! 我不想死!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gill! Don't let me go belly-up!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.59,1:15:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,冷静, 尼莫 你不会死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just calm down, Nemo. You won't go belly-up.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.92,1:16:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我保证 你不会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise. You're gonna be OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.30,1:16:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,达拉!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darla!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.80,1:16:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这些船里面 有没有你觉得熟悉的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do any of these boats look familiar to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.57,1:16:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,没有, 但那艘船一定在这里的某个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but the boat has to be here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.51,1:16:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,快点, 多莉 我们要找到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Dory. We're gonna find it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.68,1:16:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我太兴奋了 你兴奋吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm totally excited. Are you excited?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.45,1:16:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,多莉, 醒醒 醒醒, 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory, wake up. Wake up, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.25,1:16:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,鸭子!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Duck!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.12,1:16:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是鸭子 那是…鹈鹕!\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not a duck. It's a... pelican!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.50,1:16:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哇 - 啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whoa! - Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.61,1:16:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哇 - 啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whoa! - Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.86,1:16:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不! 我来从这么远来 不是为了当他早餐的!\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! I didn't come this far to be breakfast!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.64,1:16:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿, 祖哥 你瞧那边?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Nigel. Would you look at that?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.14,1:16:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,什么? 什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.54,1:16:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,太阳刚刚升起 而吉拉德就被撑得走不动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sun's barely up and Gerald's had more than he can handle.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.45,1:16:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 找个人去帮帮这个可怜的家伙吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Reckon somebody ought to help the poor guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.12,1:16:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,是的, 没错 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, right. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.15,1:17:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,那就不劳你们大驾了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't everybody fly off at once.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.89,1:17:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的, 吉拉德 鱼塞住你的舌头了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Gerald. Fish got your tongue?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.86,1:17:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 啊! - 喜欢一只鸭子!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Aah! - Love a duck!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.46,1:17:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 啊! - 喜欢一只鸭子!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Aah! - Love a duck!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.86,1:17:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我得去找我儿子尼莫!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta find my son Nemo!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.60,1:17:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,尼莫? 他就是那条鱼!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nemo? He's that fish!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.74,1:17:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,那条打遍大海无敌手的鱼!\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one that's been fighting the whole ocean!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.34,1:17:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你儿子在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know where your son... Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.44,1:17:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,等等! 回来! 停下来!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! Come back! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.18,1:17:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,多莉, 继续走! 他疯了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory, keep going! He's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.45,1:17:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我有事要告诉你!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got something to tell you!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.55,1:17:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.12,1:17:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,千万别轻举妄动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't make any sudden moves.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.69,1:17:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,要想活命, 就跳进我的嘴里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hop inside my mouth if you want to live.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.00,1:17:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,跳进你的嘴里? 那我们怎么能活命吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hop in your mouth? How does that make me live?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.67,1:17:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.87,1:17:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我能带你去见你儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I can take you to your son.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.20,1:17:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不, 你只能带我去见儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I can take you to your son.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.54,1:17:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是的, 没错 - 不 我认识你儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, right. - No. I know your son.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.24,1:17:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,他是橙色的, 有一边鳍有残障\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's orange with a gimpy fin on one side.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.98,1:18:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是尼莫!- 啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's Nemo! - Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.18,1:18:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我的! 我的! 我的! 我的!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine! Mine! Mine! Mine!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.83,1:18:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.39,1:18:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,系紧你们的安全带!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fasten your seat belts!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.02,1:18:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我的! 我的! 我的! 我的! 我的!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine! Mine! Mine! Mine! Mine!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.22,1:18:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我的! 我的! 我的! 我的!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine! Mine! Mine! Mine!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.24,1:18:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,喔！呜呼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo! Whoo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.41,1:18:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,哈哈哈哈!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.45,1:18:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.58,1:18:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,大家坐稳了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody hold on!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.76,1:18:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 啊 - 啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Aah! - Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.15,1:18:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我的! 我的! 我的! 我的! 我的!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine! Mine! Mine! Mine! Mine!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.76,1:18:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,太吵了! 吵死我了了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}BUBBLES: Too loud! Too loud for me!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.43,1:18:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 一闪, 一闪, 小星星 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Twinkle, twinkle, little star ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.69,1:18:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我要搬走! 找个安全的地方!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find a happy place! Find a happy place!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.60,1:18:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,达拉, 你的叔叔要立刻见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darla, your uncle will see you now.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.17,1:18:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,好的, 我们来看看那些小乳牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's see those pearly whites.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.74,1:19:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我是食人鱼住在亚马逊河\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raah! I'm a piranha. They're in the Amazon.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.08,1:19:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,食人鱼也是一种鱼 就像你的生日礼物一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a piranha's a fish, just like your present.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.88,1:19:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我有鱼了, 鱼了 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I get fishy, fishy ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.68,1:19:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,啊, 不 可怜的小家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. Poor little guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.82,1:19:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他死了 - 鲨鱼饵!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's dead. - Sharkbait!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.69,1:19:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,鱼, 鱼, 鱼!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yay! Fishy, fishy, fishy!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.92,1:19:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我大概把你的礼物忘在车里了, 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must've left your present in the car, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.56,1:19:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 啊! - 我这就去帮你拿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ohh! - I'll go and get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.89,1:19:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他还活着! - 她没死!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's still alive! - He's not dead!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.66,1:19:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了? 他为什么要装死?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening? Why is he playing dead?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.73,1:19:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,它会被冲进下水道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna get flushed down the toilet.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.63,1:19:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他要离开这里了! - 他将被冲走!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's gonna get out of here! - He's gonna get flushed!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.07,1:19:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,多么聪明的小家伙!\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a smart little guy!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.87,1:19:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,啊, 不! 是垃圾桶!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no! Not the trash can!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.47,1:19:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,尼莫! 不!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nemo! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.81,1:19:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿! 我找到他爸爸了! - 尼莫在哪里?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey! I found his dad! - Where's Nemo?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.24,1:19:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 牙医! - 他在那边!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dentist! - He's over there!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.64,1:19:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,什么是牙医? 祖哥, 快进去!\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's a dentist? Nigel, get in there!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.08,1:19:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不能进去! - 你能行的! 祖哥!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't go in there! - Yes, you can! Charge!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.52,1:19:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 啊 - 什么鬼?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Aah! - What the...?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.32,1:19:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,多拉, 宝贝, 小心!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darla, sweetie, look out!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.33,1:19:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 啊 - 别动!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Aah! - Hold still!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.53,1:19:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 啊 - 安静! 别紧张!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Aah! - Easy! Easy!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.77,1:20:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 啊 - 别动!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Aah! - Hold still!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.03,1:20:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,没有人会伤害你的!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody's going to hurt you! Oof!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.28,1:20:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,尼莫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nemo.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.71,1:20:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,啊, 我的老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my goodness.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.01,1:20:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,抓到了! 别乱动!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotcha! Keep down!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.95,1:20:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,尼莫!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nemo!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.25,1:20:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.02,1:20:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你出去! 出去!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out with you! And stay out!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.89,1:20:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,老爸?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.26,1:20:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,小鱼?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fishy?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.69,1:20:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,小鱼! 醒醒!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fishy! Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.86,1:20:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,啊, 不!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.06,1:20:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,快上山顶上去!\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the top of Mount Wannahockaloogie!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.63,1:20:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么在睡觉?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you sleeping?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.07,1:20:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快点! - 祖祖!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hurry! - Bloat!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.57,1:20:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,开火!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ring of Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.68,1:20:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,小鱼!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fishy! Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.72,1:20:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,啊! 这些动物简直都发疯了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crikey! All the animals have gone mad!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.76,1:20:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unh!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.59,1:20:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,出去!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aaah! Get it out!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.19,1:20:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 砸她的头! - 快, 吉哥, 快!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Smack her in the head! - Go, Gill, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.79,1:21:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,鱼在我的头发里!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fish in my hair!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.83,1:21:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,吉哥!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gill!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.23,1:21:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,鲨鱼饵… 代我向你老爸问好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharkbait... tell your dad I said hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.71,1:21:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 啊！- 哎哟！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Unh! - Eww!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.77,1:21:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,成功了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go get 'em!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.02,1:21:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,哦...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohh...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.04,1:21:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他成功了! - 是的!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He did it! - Yay!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.81,1:21:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我太高兴了! - 他没事吧, 吉哥?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm so happy! - Is he gonna be OK, Gill?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.78,1:21:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心 条条水管通大海\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. All drains lead to the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.05,1:21:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,小鱼!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fishy!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.33,1:21:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.64,1:21:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 哇哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah! Whoa! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.33,1:21:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.47,1:22:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我很难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.47,1:22:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,真的, 没能帮到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Truly, I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.94,1:22:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,真是对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Truly, I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.12,1:22:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 多莉…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. - Dory...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.36,1:22:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,如果不是因为你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}if it wasn't for you...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.46,1:22:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我永远不可能成功来到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never would've even made it here.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.30,1:22:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,所以, 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.40,1:22:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿, 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.17,1:22:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 你要去哪里?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.77,1:22:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,完了, 多莉 我们太迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over, Dory. We were too late.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.37,1:23:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,尼莫死了, 我现在也要回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nemo's gone, and I'm going home now.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.18,1:23:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不, 你不能走\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, you can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.52,1:23:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,停下来!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.89,1:23:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,请别走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't go away.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.69,1:23:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.66,1:23:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,以前从来没有任何人和我相处这么久的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one's ever stuck with me for so long before.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.46,1:23:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,而且如果你一走, 我只有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you leave, I just...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.06,1:23:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,跟你在一起的事情才能记住事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember things better with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.03,1:23:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我…是这样的 瞧-P . 歇尔曼, 42号…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do. Look... P. Sherman, 42...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.07,1:23:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,42... 42...\N{\fnArial\fs30}42... 42...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.04,1:23:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我记得 我记得 就在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember it. I do. It's there.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.84,1:23:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道那是因为我看着你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it is because when I look at you...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.98,1:23:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我能感觉到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can feel it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.45,1:23:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,看着你 会让我有家的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I look at you and I... I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.09,1:23:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,求你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.72,1:23:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想失去这种感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want that to go away.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.39,1:23:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想忘记\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to forget.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.09,1:23:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起, 多莉, 但我想…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Dory, but I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.44,1:24:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 上天的赏赐 - 生活的甜露!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Manna from heaven. - Sweet nectar of life!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.75,1:24:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿! 嘿! 嘿!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.85,1:24:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是我们的地头! - 离开这里!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is our spot! - Get outta here!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.59,1:24:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿! 嘿! 嘿!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.79,1:24:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,是的, 就是它, 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's it, fella.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.29,1:24:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,继续游 别回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just keep on swimmin'. You got that.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.96,1:24:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,太对了, 伙伴!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too right, mate!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.03,1:24:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,啊! 我在这里找到个活的!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! I got a live one here!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.36,1:24:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你见过我老爸吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you seen my dad?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.83,1:24:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,抓住他! 嘿! 嘿! 回这里来!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotcha! Hey! Hey! Come back here!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.10,1:24:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你放跑了他!\N{\fnArial\fs30}You let him go!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.63,1:24:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿! 嘿!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.77,1:24:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,老爸! 老爸!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad! Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.31,1:24:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,老爸!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.89,1:24:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohh!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.32,1:24:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,打扰了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.43,1:24:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.69,1:24:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道我在那里 我不知道发生了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know where I am. I don't know what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.36,1:24:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我丢了个人, 但我记不起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I lost somebody, but I can't remember.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.27,1:25:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的 我也正在找个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's OK. I'm looking for someone, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.40,1:25:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿, 我们可以一起找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, we can look together.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.87,1:25:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫多莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Dory.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.24,1:25:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫尼莫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Nemo.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.44,1:25:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,尼莫? 很好听的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nemo? That's a nice name.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.75,1:25:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 老爸! - 老爸!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dad! - Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.72,1:25:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 他是你老爸还是我的老爸?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. Is it your dad or my dad?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.83,1:25:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我老爸 - 知道了 老爸!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My dad. - Got it. Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.33,1:25:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 可是, 我们现在在哪里呢? - 老爸! 老爸!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are we, anyway? - Dad! Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.63,1:25:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 悉尼-梨-悉尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Syl... Shi... Sydney.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.57,1:25:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,悉尼, 袋鼠路, 42号 P . 歇尔曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}P. Sherman, 42 Wallaby Way, Sydney.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.87,1:25:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,尼莫!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah! Nemo!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.67,1:25:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,是你! 你是尼莫!\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's you! Aah! You're Nemo!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.08,1:25:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,是的, 是的, 我是尼莫!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, yes, I'm Nemo!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.78,1:25:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你是尼莫! 你已经死了呀 我见到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Nemo! You were dead. I saw you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.41,1:25:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,而你却在这里! 我找到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here you are! I found you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.35,1:25:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你没有死 而你的老爸-你老爸!\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not dead. And your father... Your father!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.12,1:25:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你认识我老爸? ! 他在哪里?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know my father? ! Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.52,1:25:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这边! 他从这个方向走了 快点!\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way! He went this way. Quick!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.39,1:26:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿, 嘿, 嘿!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.06,1:26:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿! 嘿!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.26,1:26:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你见过一条橙色的鱼游过去吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you seen an orange fish swim by?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.80,1:26:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 就像他! - 但大一点!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It looks just like him! - But bigger!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.20,1:26:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,是的, 我见过他, 很悲伤的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I saw him, bluey.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.47,1:26:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,但我不会告诉你他去那里了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm not tellin' you where he went...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.97,1:26:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,而且打死我也不说\N{\fnArial\fs30}and there's no way you're gonna make me.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.51,1:26:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.77,1:26:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,好的! 我说!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah! All right! I'll talk!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.58,1:26:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,他往鱼群那边去了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}He went to the fishing grounds! Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.28,1:26:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿, 小心!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look out!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.19,1:26:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 我光想着回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I'm just trying to get home.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.72,1:26:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,老爸! 老爸!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad! Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.49,1:26:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,尼莫?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nemo?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.93,1:26:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 老爸! - 尼莫?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Daddy! - Nemo?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.43,1:26:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 老爸! - 尼莫活着!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dad! - Nemo's alive!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.20,1:26:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 老爸! - 尼莫活着!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dad! - Nemo's alive!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.47,1:26:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,多莉? 尼莫!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory? Nemo!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.50,1:26:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,老爸!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.74,1:26:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,尼莫! 我来了, 尼莫!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nemo! I'm coming, Nemo!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.07,1:26:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 老爸! - 尼莫! 感谢上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dad! - Nemo! Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.77,1:26:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,都好吧, 儿子 都好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right, son. It's gonna be OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.74,1:26:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,回头! 你游错方向了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}GROUPER: Turn around! You're going the wrong way!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.12,1:26:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,小心!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah! Look out!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.52,1:27:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,啊, 我的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.87,1:27:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,救命! 救-命!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! He-e-elp!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.47,1:27:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 多莉! - 快!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dory! - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.11,1:27:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,救命! 救命!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.54,1:27:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,救命! 救我们出去!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! Get us out! Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.31,1:27:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不, 不, 不! 多莉!\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no! Dory!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.15,1:27:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 老爸, 我有办法! - 尼莫! 不!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dad, I know what to do! - Nemo! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.18,1:27:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的告诉所有的鱼一起向下游!\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to tell all the fish to swim down together!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.95,1:27:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你快出来! - 我知道这一定行!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get out of there now! - I know this will work!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.69,1:27:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不, 我不能再失去你了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I am not gonna lose you again!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.66,1:27:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,没时间了! 这是救多莉的唯一的办法!\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no time! It's the only way to save Dory!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.40,1:27:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我能行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.03,1:27:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.20,1:27:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you can.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.07,1:27:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 祝你好运! - 现在, 去! 快点!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lucky fin! - Now, go! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.01,1:27:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉所有的鱼向下游!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell all the fish to swim down!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.84,1:28:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯? 你们听我儿子的! 快点!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well? You heard my son! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.71,1:28:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,多莉, 你得告诉所有人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dory, you have to tell everybody to...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.38,1:28:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,一起向下游!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Swim down together!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.95,1:28:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你明白我对你说的话了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand what I'm saying to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.25,1:28:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,向下游!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Swim down!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.86,1:28:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,大家向下游!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody swim down!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.13,1:28:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,快点, 你们得向下游!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, you have to swim down!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.70,1:28:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,向下! 向下游!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down! Swim down!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.50,1:28:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,向下游! 向下游!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Swim down! Swim down!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.85,1:28:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,继续游!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't give up! Keep swimming!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.28,1:28:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,继续游!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just keep swimming!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.96,1:28:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这样!\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.53,1:28:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这有效!\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's working!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.97,1:28:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,继续游! 继续游!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep swimming! Keep swimming!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.04,1:28:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,继续游! 继续游!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just keep swimming! Keep swimming!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.20,1:28:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,快点, 老爸!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.71,1:29:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你干得太好, 儿子! - 那是我老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're doing great, son! - That's my dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.24,1:29:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我们游到海底! 继续游!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get to the bottom! Keep swimming!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.58,1:29:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 一起往下游, 一起往下游 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Just keep swimming, just keep swimming ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.15,1:29:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,快到了! 继续游!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost there! Keep swimming!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.92,1:29:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,继续游!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep swimming!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.56,1:29:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,继续游!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep swimming!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.05,1:29:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 噢 - 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oof! - Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.60,1:29:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 多莉! 尼莫在哪里? - 这边!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dory! Where's Nemo? - There!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.91,1:29:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,啊, 不 尼莫!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. Nemo!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.92,1:29:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,尼莫?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nemo?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.49,1:29:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,尼莫?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nemo?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.82,1:29:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的 爸爸在这里 爸爸找到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's OK. Daddy's here. Daddy's got you.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.26,1:29:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.47,1:30:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,啊, 感谢上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.03,1:30:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,老爸…我不恨你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad... I don't hate you.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.77,1:30:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,啊, 不, 不, 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.64,1:30:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉, 尼莫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry, Nemo.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.55,1:30:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿, 猜得到吗? - 什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, guess what? - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.45,1:30:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,海龟-我遇到一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sea turtles... I met one.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.99,1:30:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,他有150岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he was 150 years old.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.23,1:30:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 150岁? - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 150? - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.43,1:30:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,山笛叔叔说它们只能活到100岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sandy Plankton said they only live to be 100.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.30,1:30:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,山笛叔叔?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sandy Plankton?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.91,1:30:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,难道你爸爸走遍了五湖四海…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think I would cross the entire ocean...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.94,1:30:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,知道的还没有一个山笛叔叔多?\N{\fnArial\fs30}and not know as much as Sandy Plankton?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.08,1:30:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哈哈哈 - 他是150岁! 不是100岁!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ha ha ha! - He was 150! Not 100!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.78,1:30:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,那个一窍不通的山笛叔叔是谁?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is this Sandy Plankton who knows everything?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.35,1:30:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,该上学了! 起床! 我们走!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time for school! Get up! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.95,1:30:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,该上学了! 起床! 我们走!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time for school! Get up! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.99,1:30:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我会赢得! - 不, 你不会!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm gonna win! - No, you're not!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.12,1:31:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我赢了! - 我的儿子赢了我!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I did it! - Aw, my own son beats me!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.93,1:31:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,上船了, 探险家们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Climb aboard, explorers.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.43,1:31:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,海参看着软体动物说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sea cucumber looks over to the mollusk and says...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.60,1:31:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,"有这样的朋友, 我们还怕敌人干什么啊"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"With fronds like these, who needs anemones?"
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.17,1:31:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你好, 尼莫 这是谁?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Nemo. Who's this?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.51,1:31:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 外国留学生 - 我是顺着东奥洋流来的朋友!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Exchange student. - I'm from the E.A.C., dude!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.01,1:31:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真可爱! - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sweet! - Totally.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.68,1:31:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,真的, 玛蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, Marty.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.68,1:31:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的做过你所说的那些事吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you really do all the things you say you did?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.68,1:31:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.42,1:31:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello. - Ohh.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.16,1:31:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,别慌张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be alarmed.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.86,1:31:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我们想要确保我们的新成员安全到家\N{\fnArial\fs30}We wanted to make sure our newest member got home safely.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.66,1:31:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢, 伙计们 - 下礼拜见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks, guys. - See you next week.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.03,1:31:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 训练计划一定要进行下去 - 记住, 鱼类是朋友…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Keep up with the program. - Remember, fish are friends...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.53,1:31:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不是食物! 再见!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not food! Bye!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.94,1:31:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,抓稳了, 我们出发!\N{\fnArial\fs30}MR. RAY: Hold on, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.84,1:31:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,下一站-知识海洋!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next stop... knowledge!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.57,1:31:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,再见, 儿子! 祝你愉快!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye, son! Have fun!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.08,1:31:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,再见, 老爸!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.41,1:31:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,啊! 雷老师, 等等 我忘了点事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Mr. Ray, wait. I forgot something.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.52,1:32:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你, 老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love you, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.19,1:32:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我也爱你, 儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, too, son.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.46,1:32:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,老爸? 你可以走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad? You can let go now.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.90,1:32:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 去探险吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Go have an adventure.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.67,1:32:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,再见! 回头见, 朋友们!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good-bye! See ya later, dudes!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.00,1:32:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 再见, 艾莫! - 尼莫\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bye, Elmo! - Nemo.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.47,1:32:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 再见, 尼莫! - 放学后见, 多莉!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bye, Nemo! - See you after school, Dory!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.97,1:32:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,再见, 爸爸!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.37,1:32:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,再见, 爸爸!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.88,1:32:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,再见, 儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye, son.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.00,1:32:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,芭芭拉, 我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barbara, I don't understand it.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.03,1:32:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这个东西说是永久耐用的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here this thing has a lifetime guarantee...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.43,1:32:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,却说坏就坏了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it breaks!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.70,1:32:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我得亲自清理鱼缸了, 把鱼都弄出来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to clean the tank myself, take all the fish out...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.04,1:32:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,把他们放在袋子里, 然后...\N{\fnArial\fs30}put 'em in bags, and...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.44,1:32:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,鱼都去哪里了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd the fish go?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.78,1:33:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 来呀, 桃桃! - 快点!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, Peach! - Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.55,1:33:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你行的! - 就是它\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can do it! - That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.42,1:33:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,再远一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a little further.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.89,1:33:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这个红灯间隔是我见过的最短的!\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the shortest red light I've ever seen!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.16,1:33:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快点, 桃桃! - 哦 啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, Peach! - Ohh. Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.73,1:33:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,现在怎么办?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now what?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.70,1:33:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 在海那边某个地方有个人在为我等候 ∮\N{\FNARIAL\FS30}∮ SOMEWHERE BEYOND THE SEA SOMEWHERE, WAITIN' FOR ME ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.04,1:33:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我的爱人站在金色沙滩上 ∮\N{\FNARIAL\FS30}∮ MY LOVER STANDS ON GOLDEN SANDS ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.81,1:33:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 目送着船只 ∮\N{\FNARIAL\FS30}∮ AND WATCHES THE SHIPS ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.35,1:33:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 驶向远方 ∮\N{\FNARIAL\FS30}∮ THAT GO SAILIN' ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.42,1:33:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 在海那边某个地方 ∮\N{\FNARIAL\FS30}∮ SOMEWHERE BEYOND THE SEA ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.72,1:34:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 她在那里注视着我 ∮\N{\FNARIAL\FS30}∮ SHE'S THERE WATCHIN' FOR ME ∮
